1 OCCU
1 TITL Lt.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Robert was born December 08, 1627 in Ipswich, Suffolk, England, the second son of Nathaniel the Settler, and died 1681 in Branford, CT.  Burial: Hatfield,Hampshire,Massachusetts [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:  Nathaniel Foote and Elizabeth Deming
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Sara Potter in 1659 in Wethersfield, CT. They resided in Weathersfield, Wallingford. and finally moved to Branford CT in 6 AUG 1659.
2 CONT
2 CONT After Roberts death in 1681, Sara married again to Aaron Blachley of Branford in the year 1668. They lived in Guilford, CT. Robert and Sara had eight children. (See Vol I. Pgs 28 and 29 for more information)
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of ROBERT FOOTE and SARAH POTTER are:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Nathaniel Foote b. April 13, 1660; d. 1714, Branford, CT; m. TABITHA BISHOP, Abt. 1680; b. Abt. 1660, Guilford, CT; d. 1715.
2 CONT # Sarah Foote b. February 02, 1661/62; m. (1) ISSAC CURTIS, Abt. 1680; b. Abt. 1660, Wallingford, CT; d. July 15, 1712; m. (2) NATHANIEL HOW, Abt. 1713; b. Abt. 1661.
2 CONT # Elizabeth Foote b. March 06, 1665/66; d. May 1730; m. JOHN GRAVES, Abt. 1686; b. Abt. 1664.
2 CONT # Joseph Foote b. March 06, 1665/66; d. March 06, 1750/51, North Branford, Ct; m. (1) ABIGAIL JOHNSON, 1690; b. April 09, 1670, New Haven, Ct; d. Abt. 1709; m. (2) SARAH ROSE, 1710; b. Abt. 1666, Branford, CT; d. June 03, 1741; m.
2 CONC  (3) SUSANNAH FRISBIE, September 03, 1741; d. May 17, 1767.
2 CONT # Samuel Foote b. May 14, 1668; d. 1696, Branford, CT; m. ABIGAIL BARKER, Bef. November 1694; b. Abt. 1668.
2 CONT # John Foote b. July 24, 1670; d. 1713, Branford, CT; m. MARY ?, 1696; b. Abt. 1670.
2 CONT # Stephen Foote b. December 14, 1672; d. October 23, 1762; m. (1) H HOWD; m. (2) ELIZABETH NASH, 1702; d. January 15, 1738/39. (twin to Isaac Foote)
2 CONT # Isaac Foote b. December 14, 1672; d. February 11, 1758, North Branford, Ct; m. REBECCA DICKERMAN, 1709; b. Abt. 1673; d. October 15, 1757, North Branford, Ct. (Twin to Stephen Foote)
2 CONT
2 CONT footnotes:
2 CONT # Hatfield MA is not so close to Branford CT.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT #  Donald L. Jacobus, Families of Ancient New Haven, 1922-1932, 3 volumes.
2 CONT # [http://archive.org/stream/thefootefamily00goodrich#page/174/mode/2up Abram W. Foote, Foote Family comprising the genealogy and history of Nathaniel Foote of Wethersfield, Conn. and his descendants, Tuttle, Rutland, VT, 1907.]. 
2 CONC Page 174.
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT # [http://www.footefamily.org/robert.htm Foote Family Association of America]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Taken from "Find a Grave" 08/27/14 http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=101536980 Robert Foote married Sarah Potter 1659 in Wallingford, New Haven, CT. Known children:
2 CONT * Nathaniel b 1660
2 CONT * Sarah b 1662
2 CONT * Elizabeth b 1663
2 CONT * Joseph b 1664
2 CONT * Isaac b 1672
2 CONT * Stephen b 1672
2 CONT * Israel b 1674
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Nathaniel resided in Wethersfield, Wallingford, and in 1668 Branford, CT
2 CONT
