1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Sarah Potter of New Haven was born ca 1639. She was baptized in the First Congregational Society, New Haven, on [http://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll?db=milloth&ti=0&h=104211888 22 Aug 1641.] 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Family==
2 CONT
2 CONT * daughter of William Potter (b ca 1608-Jun 1662) & Frances Child (b ca 1610-Jun 1662).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married 
2 CONT # ca 1659 married Robert Foote (1627-1681).  He was the son of Nathaniel Foote & Elizabeth Deming.
2 CONT # in 1668  Sara married again to Aaron Blachley of Branford.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Sarah Potter and Robert Foote:
2 CONT # 12330 	i. 	Ens. Nathaniel Foote (13 Apr 1660-1709)
2 CONT # 12331 	ii. 	Sarah Foote (12 Feb 1661[/2]-)
2 CONT # 12332 	iii. 	Elizabeth Foote (18 Mar 1663/4-May 1730)
2 CONT # 12333 	iv. 	Capt. Joseph Foote (6 Mar 1665/6-6 Mar 1751)
2 CONT # 12334 	v. 	Samuel Foote (14 May 1668-1696)
2 CONT # 12335 	vi. 	John Foote (24 Jul 1670-1713)
2 CONT # 12336 	vii. 	Stephen Foote (14 Dec 1672-23 Oct 1762)
2 CONT # 12337 	viii. 	Dr. Isaac Foote (14 Dec 1672-11 Feb 1758)
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources 
2 CONT # A genealogical dict. of the first settlers of New England, showing three generations of those who came before May, 1692. By James Savage. Boston. 1861. (4v.)v.3:468
2 CONT #  Donald L. Jacobus, Families of Ancient New Haven, 1922-1932, 3 volumes."Lieut. Robert Foote. Born on 8 Dec 1627 in Ipswich, Suffolk, Eng. Robert died in 1681 in Branford, CT".30
2 CONT
2 CONT Links
2 CONT # [http://www.footefamily.org/robert.htm Foote Family Association of America]
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sarah Potter Blatchley Memorial
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	Aug. 22, 1641 Wallingford New Haven County Connecticut, USA Death: 	Aug. 23, 1706 Branford New Haven County Connecticut, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 1st: Robert Foote (1627-1681) on 6 August 1659, and 2nd: Aaron Blatchley in 1686. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Parents:
2 CONT   William Potter (1608 - 1684)
2 CONT   Frances Child Potter (1609 - 1661)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Robert Foote (1627 - 1681)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Nathaniel Foote (1660 - 1714)*
2 CONT   Joseph Foote (1666 - 1751)*
2 CONT   Joseph Foot (1666 - 1751)*
2 CONT   Samuel Foote (1668 - 1696)*
2 CONT   John Foote (1670 - 1713)*
2 CONT   John Foote (1670 - 1713)*
2 CONT   Stephen Foot (1672 - 1762)*
2 CONT   Isaac Foote (1672 - 1758)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Sibling:
2 CONT   Joseph Potter (1635 - 1669)*
2 CONT   Sarah Potter Blatchley (1641 - 1706)
2 CONT
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Branford Center Cemetery  Branford New Haven County Connecticut, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: Kate Cuneo Record added: Apr 09, 2014  Find A Grave Memorial# 127715483
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sarah   Potter Birth:   22 AUG 1641, New Haven,New Haven,Connecticut Christening:   22 AUG 1641, New Haven,New Haven,Connecticut Death:   23 AUG 1706, Prob. Branford,New Haven,Connecticut Burial :   Unknown Children:    Eight Chil
2 CONC dren Marriage:   Robert Foote Generation:   Second Generation In America Father:   William Potter Mother:  Francis Potter
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Robert Foote, Son of Nathaniel Foote (10), in 1659 6 AUG 1659, Of Stonington, N. London,Conn. They resided in Wethersfield, Wallingford. and finally moved to Branford CT in 6 AUG 1659.  Children of Robert Foote and Sar
2 CONC ah Potter are:
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel Foote Born April 13, 1660; Died 1714, Branford, CT; Married Tabitha Bishop, About. 1680; Shee was born about 1660, in Guilford, CT; and died 1715.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Foote Born February 02, 1661/62; Married (1) Issac Curtis, about. 1680; He was born about 1660, in Wallingford, CT; He died July 15, 1712; Married her 2nd Nathaniel How about 1713. he was born abour 1661
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Foote Born March 6, 1666 Elizabeth was the second daughter of Robert Foote (25). She was married January 12 1685 to John Graves, the son of John and Elizabeth (Stillwell) Graves of East Guilford Connecticut. He died Dece
2 CONC mber 1 1726 at the age of 68. She died in May of the year 1730 at the age of 64. She had ten children. (see Vol-I, page 29)
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Foote Born March 06, 1665/66; Died March 06, 1750/51, North Branford, Ct; Married (1) Abigal Johnson, 1690; She was born on April 09, 1670, in New Haven, Ct; She died about 1709; Married (2) Sarah Rose, in the year 1710; Sh
2 CONC e was born Abt. 1666, in Branford, CT; She died June 03, 1741; Married. (3) Susannah Frisbe on September 03, 1741; She died May 17, 1767.
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Foote Samuel was born on May 14, 1668 the third son of Robert Foote (5) He married Abigail Barker in1694, He died in the year 1696. They resided in Bradford, Connecticut. (see Vol-1, page 32 for information on their child.)
2 CONT
2 CONT John Foote Born. July 24, 1670; Died. 1713, Branford, CT; Married MARY ?, 1696; b. Abt. 1670.
2 CONT
2 CONT Stephen Foote Born December 14, 1672; Died October 23, 1762; Married (1) H. Howd; Married (2) Elizabeth Nash, 1702; Died January 15, 1738/39. (twin to Isaac Foote)
2 CONT
2 CONT Dr. Isaac Foote Born December 14, 1672; Died February 11, 1758, North Branford, Ct; Married Rebecca Dickerman, 1709; b. Abt. 1673; d. October 15, 1757, North Branford, Ct. (Twin to Stephen Foote)
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 2: Aaron Blatchley  MARRIAGE: 1686, New Haven,New Haven,Connecticut
