1 NOTE Sarah Potter was christened on 22 August 1641 in New Haven, New Haven, Connecticut. She was born on Thursday, 22 August 1641 in Wallingford, New Haven, Connecticut. She was the daughter of William Potter and Frances (?). At the ag
2 CONC e of 14, Sarah Potter married John Sanford on Saturday, 19 February 1656 in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts. Robert Foote married Sarah Potter at the age of 31 and 17 on Wednesday, 6 August 1659 in Stonington, New London, Connectic
2 CONC ut. She died on Monday, 23 August 1706 in Branford, New Haven, Connecticut at the age of 65 years and 1 day.
