1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hephzibah was born on 2 Apr 1680 to Nathaniel Starbuck and Mary Coffin at Nantucket, Massachusetts. [1]. She died on 1 Sep 1740 at Nantucket. [2]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Starbuck-21
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the wife of Thomas Hathaway, son of Arthur Hathaway Jr. and Sarah Cooke. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Thomas and Hepzibeth (Starbuck) Hathaway:[3]
2 CONT # Antipas, b. 5 October 1698, m. 13 September 1729 Patience Church
2 CONT # Apphiah, b. 13 May 1701, m. 18 October 1718 Adam Mott
2 CONT # Pernal, b. 3 June 1703, d. 6 October 1715
2 CONT # Elizabeth, b. 18 October 1706, m. 27 June 1727 John Clerk
2 CONT # Mary, b. 3 October 1709, m. 7 November 1734 Thomas Kempton
2 CONT # Thomas, b. 5 December 1711, m. 25 January 1750 Lois Taber
2 CONT # Nathaniel Hathaway, b. 23 June 1715, not mentioned in will
2 CONT # Hepzibeth, b. 18 March 1718, m. Samuel Wing
2 CONT # Jethro, b. July 1720, m. 3 September 1741 Hannah West
