2 CONT
2 CONT Memories might have been weak for the birth date and age for Charity. The dual dating for the conversion to the Gregorian calendar (1752 for Britain) might have confused the dating. Reading the headstone inscription might have int
2 CONC roduced some errors. The date of death is given as 29 February, however, both 1639 and 1659 were not leap years.
