2 CONT 380.17.00
2 CONT THE LAND.
2 CONT Ten acres of home lots wth one dwelling house and 2 barnes wth other build-
2 CONT ing thereuppon.
2 CONT 4 acres of home lotts. 6 acres of meadow wth an acre of swampe.
2 CONT SO acres of plaine fenced in being 14 ac broke up.
2 CONT 7 acres of the plaine meadow plowed up.
2 CONT 20 acres in the great meadow of hay ground.
2 CONT 4 acres in the bever meadow.
2 CONT 27 acres of swampe ground.
2 CONT 81 acres of upland in the weste field. 32 rod broad beyond the Kiver being three myles in length.
2 CONT RICHAED TREAT.
2 CONT SAMUEL SMITH.
2 CONT NATHANIEL DICKENSON.
2 CONT A debt formerly forgotten wch the said Deceased Nath: Foote did owe. 1.10.00
2 CONT Dated November the 20th, 1644. Land devided to theWydowe ffoote. 4 ac home lott when her howse is 20 . 00 . 00
2 CONT The howseing 50.00.00
2 CONT 2 ae unsubdued 4.00.00
2 CONT 7 ac plaine brok 28.00.00
2 CONT 314 plaine med : 20 . 00 . 00
2 CONT 14 ac meadow 70.00.00
