2 CONC  Death: Oct. 10, 1634 Greater London, England Parents: John Brooke (1540 - 1584) Elizabeth Whatman Brooke (1535 - 1599) Children: Nathaniel Foote (1593 - 1644)* Burial: St Leonard Churchyard, Shoreditch, Greater London, England 
