2 CONT ca 1646 Elizabeth second married Gov. Thomas Welles, son of Robert Welles (ca Nov 1540-ca 1617) & Alice [Welles] (-aft 5 Jul 1615), in Wethersfield, CT.167 Born ca 1590 in Stourton, Whichford Parish, Warwickshire, Eng. Thomas died
2 CONC  on 14 Jan 1659/60 in Wethersfield, CT.4
