2 CONT The original will of Mrs. Foote, alias Welles, from which I copy, is in the
2 CONT handwriting of Eev. Joseph Eowlandson, minister of Wethersfield; the codicil, or "Memorandum," in that of Samuel Tallcott, of Wethersfield, son of John Talcott,one of the first settlers of Hartford.
2 CONT ELIZABETH, b. abt. 1616; m. 1638, Josiah Churchill, of Wethers-
2 CONT field, Ct. He d. abt. Jan. 1, 1686. She d. Sept, 8, 1700. Ch.:
