2 CONT Mo., and ch.: (1) Mary, who. m. Oliver H. Picher, (2) Lieu-
2 CONT tenant Comdr. Francis Henry Sheppard, and (3) Miss Margaret
2 CONT Sheppard, are descendants of Elizabeth through Henry
