2 CONT Notes
2 CONT # "Engish Origin of the Potter and Beecher Families of New Haven, Connecticut," The American Genealogist, Vol. 79, pp. 28-33; pub. January/April 2004 issue.
2 CONT # probably came in the Abigal from London, in 1635, aged 27, with wife Francis, aged 26, and child Joseph, aged twenty weeks." The Abigal sailed in May of 1635. January or February of 1635 would seem reasonable for Joseph's birthd
2 CONC ate. Birth dates of the children are approximate and based on Jacobus. Hope was baptised in the First Congregational Society in October of 1641 following the baptisms in August of her sisters, Mary and Sarah. 1
2 CONT
