2 CONC    Father: John POTTER  b: 1580 in New Haven, New Haven, CT  Mother: Hannah Mrs. POTTER b: 1584 in Kent, England  Marriage 1 Frances POTTER <b: 1610 in New Haven, New Haven, CT
