1 NOTE Ruhama married as his second wife Lieut. John Smith1. He had married first on 4 Jan 1649 Deborah Howland, daughter of Arthur and Margaret of Marshfield. Deborah was still alive on 16 Oct 16651. Lieut. John Smith died 15 Jan 1692 a
2 CONC t Dartmouth, being in his 74th year1. Ruhama was still alive at the time of the 1707 agreement over her father's estate.
