2 CONC  by mark, dated March 8 and proved 2 March 1686/7, mentioned his father, brother Job and wife ( Portsmouth Land Evidences 1:257). The will of Mary Mott of Portsmouth, widow, dated 4/24 Februray 1710/11, proved 8 (7) 1712, mentione
