1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Arthur Hathaway''' was born before October 1625 at probably England.1 and died on 11 December 1711 at Dartmouth, Bristol County, Massachusetts.1
2 CONT
2 CONT >He arrived, probably with his father, in 1630.
2 CONT >''U.S. and Canada, Passenger and Immigration Lists Index, 1500s-1900s'' @[https://www.ancestry.com/discoveryui-content/view/1454334:7486?ssrc=pt&tid=174604283&pid=132550007062 '''Ancestry.com''']; '''Source Bibliography:''' Virku
2 CONC s, Frederick A., editor.'' Immigrant Ancestors: A List of 2,500 Immigrants to America before 1750.'' Baltimore: Genealogical Publishing Co., 1964. 75p. Repr. 1986.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Married:''' 20 November 1652 in Duxbury, Plymouth Plantation to Sarah Cooke, b. c 1635, d. a 26 Feb 1712/13. She was the daughter of John Cooke and Sarah Warren, 2,1.  Her father's father was Mayflower passenger Francis Cooke. 
2 CONC  Her mother's father was Mayflower Passenger Richard Warren.
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Children
2 CONT # John Hathaway+1 b. 17 Sep 1653, d. bt 11 Jul 1732 - 15 Aug 1732
2 CONT # Sarah Hathaway1 b. 28 Feb 1655/56, d. b 1710
2 CONT # Hannah Hathaway1 b. c 1660, d. Feb 13-Mar 14, 1748/9
2 CONT # Lydia Hathaway1 b. c 1662, d. 23 Jun 1714
2 CONT # Mary Hathaway1 b. c 1664, d. a 6 Jan 1735
2 CONT # Thomas Hathaway+1 b. c 1669, d. bt 5 Apr 1742 - 3 May 1748
2 CONT # Jonathan Hathaway1 b. 1672, d. 17 Sep 1727
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Event
2 CONT * 1667- selectman of Dartmouth 3
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Notes
2 CONT * Arthur 2 and Sarah (Cooke) Hathaway lived in Duxbury, MA, when the older two children were
2 CONT born but later moved to Dartmouth, MA, before 1662.  A majority of Hathaways from the Dartmouth and New Bedford areas of MA are descendants of Arthur Hathaway.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ====Wikipedia: [https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Hathaway-94 Arthur Hathaway Jr. (1625 - 1711)]
2 CONT * '''Note:''' Hyperlink to non-Ancestry "source" is defunct.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT From [http://www.mormonpioneergenealogylibrary.com/?p=1199 ancestry of Rebecca Ellis (1755-1805), mother of the Mormon pioneer Sally Tiffany] Mormon Pioneers Library
2 CONT
2 CONT * 100. Arthur HATHAWAY (parentage unknown): born abt 1595 in ,,Eng.; married; died aft 1634 in Plymouth, Plymouth, MA.
2 CONT * 101. not '''Marie LAUZON'''.
2 CONT * 50. Arthur HATHAWAY: born abt 1625 in ,,Eng.; married 20 Nov 1652 in Plymouth, Plymouth, MA; died 11 Dec 1711 in Dartmouth, Bristol, MA.
2 CONT * 51. Sarah COOKE -Mayf.: born abt 1635 in Plymouth, Plymouth, MA; died aft 26 Feb 1712-13 in Dartmouth, Bristol, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT ====Citations
2 CONT # Jr. Ralph V. Wood, Mayflower Families, Francis Cooke.
2 CONT # Plymouth Colony Records, Volume 14.
2 CONT # The Hathaway Family Association, online http://www.hathawayfamilyassociation.org/
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Arthur's parents are Arthur and Marie (Lauzon) Hathaway.
