2 CONT [[Category:Dean Name Study]]  [[Category:Taunton, Massachusetts]]
2 CONT == Biography == 
2 CONT Hannah is the daughter of [[Leonard-636|James Leonard]] and [[Martin-4457|Mary Martin]]. She married "Isack Deane" on January 4, 1677 at Taunton.<ref>Vital Records of Taunton Massachusetts to the Year 1850 Volume II-Marriages. Bos
2 CONC ton, MA: New England Historic Genealogical Society, 1928. Page 252, https://ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Bristol/Taunton/Images/Taunton_B252.shtml</ref> They had seven children together.<ref>Deane, William Reed. Genealogical Memoir of t
2 CONC he Leonard Family. Boston, MA:Self-Published for the New England Historic-Genealogical Register, 1857. Page 19. https://archive.org/details/genealogicalmemo00dean/page/19/mode/2up</ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah's death date and location are unknown.
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT # Alice b 20 Nov 1678; m John King
2 CONT # Abigail b 16 Nov 1680; m ___Torry
2 CONT # Hannah b 24 Apr 1683; m Nathaniel Hodges
2 CONT # Nathaniel b 25 Apr 1685
2 CONT # Abiah
2 CONT # Jonathan b ca 1695; m Abigail Burt
2 CONT # Deborah; "perhaps" married Joseph Allen of Burlington
2 CONT
2 CONT Hannah was born about 1659. She passed away in 1749. 
2 CONT
