2 CONT "Mary was baptized at Salem church on August 8, 1672, along with her younger sister, Elizabeth. She may have been about 12 yrs. of age.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was likely a strong woman, as she was on her own in Beverly for about 5 years after her husband left town. Further, after her husband's death in Rochester, there is record that 'she was hired once in every 15 days to sweep th
2 CONC e church to keep it decent'."
