2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Ephraim (aka Ephrim, Epherim) was born June 7 1656 in Sandwich, Massachusetts, son of William Swift.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT He married by 1679 Sarah Perry (daughter of Ezra Perry) in Sandwich, Barnstable, Massacusetts.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She is mentioned as "Sarah wife of Ephraim Swift" in the 1690 will of her father Ezra Perry.[3]
2 CONT She died in Sandwich 13 August 1734.[4]
2 CONT Ephraim died before 17 Feb 1760.[citation needed]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Born Sandwich, MA:[5]
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Lawrence (born Swift), b 29 Dec 1680 (another volume records 1679)
2 CONT Johanna Swift (m Haskell), b 7 July 1684 (another volume records 1683)
2 CONT Samuel Swift, b 8 Apr 1686
2 CONT Ephraim Swift 16 Dec 1688 - ?[6]
2 CONT Sarah Swift (m. Kirby), b 12 Apr 1692
2 CONT Hannah Swift (m Marshall), b 19 May 1695
2 CONT Moses Swift, b 15 Sept 1699 ; d 1742
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Swift-64
2 CONT
2 CONT Ephraim Swift (1656 - 1741)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Ephraim Swift===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 7 Jun 1656 in Sandwich, Barnstable, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of William Swift and Ruth (Unknown) Swift
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Hannah (Swift) Tobey, Ruth Swift, William Swift, Mary (Swift) Smith, Samuel Swift, Jirah Swift, Hester (Swift) Gibbs, Temperance (Swift) Bourne, Josiah Swift and Dinah (Swift) Perry
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Sarah (Perry) Swift — married 1678 in Sandwich, Massachusetts [uncertain]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Elizabeth (Swift) Lawrence, Joanna (Swift) Haskell, Samuel Swift, Sarah (Swift) Kirby and Moses Swift
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 10 Apr 1741 at age 84 in Sandwich, Barnstable, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 1 Aug 2020 | Created 21 Sep 2010
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ Sandwich, Mass., Vital Records, published in Mayflower Descendant, vol 14, p 110: Epherim Swift the sonn of william Swift was borne the 7th of June 1656"
