2 CONC ilman 372; Cape Cod Lib. 15:24; MD 14:172-3, 29:32; Barnstable Co. Prob. 1:70; Mrs. James T. Watts; TAG 35:40
2 CONT ↑ Barnstable, MA: Probate Records, 1685-1789, vol 1, p 36
