2 CONT EPHRAIM, second son of William and Ruth Swift (4) born June 
2 CONT 6, 1656, married Sarah--, who died before him, August 13, 
2 CONT 1734, and died at Sandwich, where he had always lived, in 1742. 
2 CONT He was a carpenter and cooper by trade. His will dated Apn1, 
2 CONT 10th, 1735, and presented at Court February 17, 1742, n..mes all 
2 CONT his children except Ephraim, Jr., who died in childhood. 
