2 CONT She's buried in the Neck O Land Cemetery in Taunton, Bristol County, Massachusetts, USA.  She outlived her husband, Major Thomas Leonard (1641-1713).  She was 81 years old when she died.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Find a Grave her parents were George Watson (1602 - 1689) and Phebe Hicks Watson (1614 - 1663).  
