2 CONT Birth
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary, the daughter of George Watson and Phebe (Hicks) Watson, was born ca 1642 at Plymouth.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage and Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary married Thomas Leonard in August of 1662.[2] They had eleven known children who were born in Taunton.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary (Leonard) Tisdale, born 02 Aug 1663[4]
2 CONT Thomas Leonard, born 22 Jan 1665[5]
2 CONT John Leonard, born 17 May 1668[6]
2 CONT George Leonard, born 18 Apr 1671[4]
2 CONT Samuel Leonard, born 1 Feb 1673/4[7]
2 CONT Elkanah Leonard, born 15 May 1677[8]
2 CONT James Leonard, born 17 Dec 1679[9]
2 CONT Unknown Leonard, stillborn, 10 Apr 1681[10]
2 CONT Seth Leonard, born 28 Apr 1682[11]
2 CONT Phoebe Leonard, born 3 Mar 1684[4]
2 CONT Elizabeth Leonard, born 5 Jul 1686[8]
2 CONT Death
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Leonard died in Taunton at age 81 on December 1, 1723.[12] She is buried at the Neck O Land Cemetery.[13]
