2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT Esther Gallup (also seen as Ester Gallop), daughter of John and Hannah(Lake) Gallup, born in Taunton, Plymouth Colony, British America, 21 July 1653;<ref name="Hodges">Hodges, Almon. ''[[Space:Genealogical Record of the Hodges Fam
2 CONC ily of New England|Genealogical Record of the Hodges Family of New England]]'' (Frank H. Hodges, Boston, 1896), pp 75-76.</ref><ref name="Reed">Reed, E. H., Esq. ''Marriages, Births and Deaths at Taunton, Mass.'', [[Space:NEHGR|Th
2 CONC e New England Historical & Genealogical Register]] (New England Historic Genealogical Society, Boston, Mass., 1863), Vol. 17, p 232.</ref>  died in Taunton, Bristol County, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British America, 1710;<ref>Sour
2 CONC ce needed.</ref>  married 17 December 1674, Henry Hodges.<ref name="Hodges"/><ref name="Gallup">Gallup, John D. ''The Genealogical History of the Gallup Family in the United States, Also Biographical Sketches of Members of the Fam
2 CONC ily''. Hartford, CT: Press of the Hartford Printing Co., 1893, pp 21-22, 26. [Digital copy available at [https://ia600204.us.archive.org/26/items/genealogicalhist00byugall/genealogicalhist00byugall.pdf Internet Archive.]]</ref><re
2 CONC f name="Torrey">Torrey, Clarence Almon. ''[[Space:Torrey’s New England Marriages Prior to 1700|Torrey’s New England Marriages Prior to 1700]]'' (Genealogical Publishing Co., Inc. Baltimore, 1985), p 378.</ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT '''From: ''Genealogical Record of the Hodges Family'', Pg. 75:''':'''3''' - Henry Hodges (2) [Wm. (1)], b. 1652, Taunton, Mass.; d. 1717 Sept. 30, Taunton, aged 65; m. 1674 Dec. 17, Taunton, '''Ester Gallop''', dau. of John & Hann
2 CONC ah (Lake) Gallop, b. 1653 July 21, Taunton. :11 children born in Taunton: - ::'''9.''' i. Mary (4) Hodges, b. 1675/6 Feb. 3. ::'''10.''' ii. Esther (4) Hodges, b. 1677/8 Feb. 17. ::'''11.''' iii. William (4) Hodges, b. 1679/80 Mar
2 CONC ch 18, ::'''12.''' iv. Charity (4) Hodges, b. 1682 April 5. ::'''13.''' v. John (4) Hodges, b. 1684. ::'''14.''' vi. Henry (4) Hodges, b. 1685 or 1686. ::'''15.''' vii. Joseph (4) Hodges, b. 1688 or 1689. ::'''16.''' viii. Benjami
2 CONC n (4) Hodges, b. about 1691. ::'''17.''' ix. Ephraim (4) Hodges, b. about 1693. ::'''18.''' x. Elizabeth (4) Hodges. ::xi. Abigail (4) Hodges. :[Continues with biographical information for Henry Hodges, and biographies of Esther (
2 CONC Gallup) Hodges' parents, John Gallop and Hannah (Lake) Gallop.]
2 CONT
2 CONT == Research Notes ==# Gallup<ref name="Gallup"/> and Torrey<ref name="Torrey"/> state Esther's birth was in New London, Connecticut Colony, 24 March 1653.  However, Hodges<ref name="Hodges"/> and Reed<ref name="Reed"/> state her b
2 CONC irth was in Taunton, Plymouth Colony, 21 July 1653.  Hodges makes his point thusly: "He [Esther's father, John Gallup] went to New London, Conn., apparently in 1650 or 1651, but probably did not take his familythere for several ye
2 CONC ars, as his daughter Ester's birth is recorded atTaunton among the children of Richard Burt."  and from Reed,<ref name="Reed"/> "The names of the children of Richard Burt: Abil, borne 5 Dec., 1657.  Ester Gollup, dr. of John Gollu
2 CONC p, borne 21 July, 1653.  Mary Burt, dr. of Richard . . . "
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==*''Genealogical Record of the Hodges Family of New England, Ending December 31, 1894'', compiled by Almon D. Hodges, Jr., Third Edition, printed for the family by Frank H. Hodges, Boston, 1896. Esther Gallop isthe wif
2 CONC e of Henry Hodges, Record #3, Taunton Branch, Pg. 75.<ref>[https://archive.org/details/genealogicalreco00hodg/page/74  Genealogical Record of the Hodges Family, Page 75.]</ref> 
