2 CONT Son of John and Mary (Bodfish) Crocker. His first wife was Hannah Howland, granddaughter of Mayflower passengers John Howland and Elizabeth Tilley Howland. Jonathan and Hannah's children were Lydia, Hannah, Thankful, Isaac, Relian
2 CONC ce, Jonathan, James, and Ephraim Crocker. Jonathan's second wife was Thankful (Trott) Hinckley. 
