1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LVMT-WFP/joseph-bodfish-1651-1744
2 CONT Brief Life History of Joseph
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Bodfish was born on 3 April 1651, in Sandwich, Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Robert Bodfish, was 39 and his mother, Bridget Sugg, was 39. He married Elizabeth Besse in June
2 CONC  1674, in Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 6 daughters. He died on 2 December 1744, in Barnstable, Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial 
2 CONC America, at the age of 93, and was buried in West Barnstable Cemetery, West Barnstable, Barnstable, Barnstable, Massachusetts, United States.
