1 NOTE Name: Robert Richard FOOTE Surname: Foote Given Name: Robert Richard Sex: M Birth: 1553 in Prob.Royston,Hertfordshire, England Death: 27 Jan 1608 in Shalford, Essex, England Burial: 16 Feb 1608 ,Shalford,Essex,England
2 CONT Note: 
2 CONT - b. about 1553, prob. at Royston, Hertfordshire; d. Jan. 27 - Feb. 15, 1608/9, London; bur. Feb. 16, 1608/9, Shalford, Essex. Son of John FOOTE and Helen WARREN. His will was dated Jan. 27, 1608/9 and proved the following Feb. 16
2 CONC th, at Shalford, Essex. He is called "my sonne in lawe Robert ffoote, Citizen and ffishemonger of London" in the will of John BROOKE. Robert married Joane on Jun. 18, 1576 at St. Leonard's in Eastcheap, London. They lived later at
2 CONC  Wethersfield, Essex.  Source: Rootsweb by RCKarnes. Mentioned in his father's will. Mentioned in his mother-in-law's will. Yeoman (European term meaning he owned land but was not nobility). Will dated 27 Jan 1608, proved 15 Feb 1
2 CONC 608. Robert was a citizen and fishmongerer on St. Thomas Street in St. Marys parish, London. He also lived in Wethersfield, Essex, England. Shalford is a parish in the northern part of Essex, a little north of Braintree, between B
2 CONC ocking and Wethersfield.
2 CONT
2 CONT   Father: John FOOTE 
2 CONT  b: 1523 in Of Royston, Hertfordshire, England  Mother: Helen WARREN 
2 CONT b: 1527/1529 in Of Bassingbourn, Cambridgeshire, England  Marriage 1 Joan BROOKE \\ b: 18 Jun 1554 in Of London, Middlesex, England c: 11 May 1555 in St Leonards, East Cheap, London, Middlesex,England 
2 CONT Married: 18 Jun 1576 in St.Leonard Eastcheap, London, Middlesex, England
2 CONT Children 
2 CONT Children of Joan BROOKE and Robert Richard FOOTE are: 
2 CONT 	i.	Robert FOOTE < was born ABT 1582 in Shalford,Essex,England, and died 17 Aug 1646 in Of Colchester, Essex, England. He married Dionis . He married Elizabeth CHILD 1603/1605, daughter of Wolstone CHILD and Ellen CHILD. 	
2 CONT 	ii.	Mary FOOTE  was born 1584 in Shalford, Essex, England, and died DEAD in Shalford, Essex, England. She married John HEWES  14 Feb 1602 in Shalford, Colchester, Essex, England. She married Richard GORE  30 Nov 1639. 	
2 CONT 	iii.	Elizabeth FOOTE  was born 1585 in Shalford, Essex, England, and died AFT Jun 1658 in Of Colchester, Essex, England. She married Thomas JENNINGS 17 Jul 1617 in St. James, Clerkenwell,Middlesex,England. He died 1658. 	
2 CONT 	iv.	James FOOTE < was born 1587 in Shalford,Essex,England, and died DEAD. He married Unknown . 	
2 CONT 	v.	David FOOTE  was born 1587 in Shalford, Essex, England, and died DEAD in Of Shalford, Essex, England.	
2 CONT 	vi.	Daniel FOOTE  was born 1590 in Shalford,Essex,England, and died DEAD in Of Colchester, Essex, England. He married Margaret TOMSON ABT 1614 in Of Shalford, Colchester, Essex, England. He married Frances . She died 1684. He mar
2 CONC ried Ann WEST . 	
2 CONT 	vii.	Joseph FOOTE  was born 1591 in Shalford, Essex, England, and died Sep 1639 in Of Colchester, Essex, England. He married Anne . 	
2 CONT 	viii.	Nathaniel FOOTE  was born 1593 in Shalford, Colchester, Essex, England, was christened ABT 1592/1593 in St. Botolph's, London, Middlesex, England, and died 20 Dec 1644 in Wethersfield, Hartford, Connecticut. He married Eliz
2 CONC abeth DEMING  Jan 1615 in Shalford, Colchester, Essex, England, daughter of Jonathan DEMING and Elizabeth GILBERT. She was born 1600 in Of, Colchester, Essex, England, and died 28 Jul 1683 in Wethersfield, Hartford, Connecticut. 	
2 CONT 	ix.	Francis Daniel FOOTE  was born 1595 in Of Colchester, Essex, England, and died 15 Dec 1624 in Of Colchester, Essex, England. He married Lydia BREWER , daughter of BREWER. He married Mrs Elizabeth FOOTE >. 	
2 CONT 	x.	Joshua FOOTE  was born 1600 in Shalford,Essex,England, and died 31 Oct 1655 in Providence, Providence, Rhode Island. He married Elizabeth ABT 1625. 	
2 CONT 	xi.	Phebe FOOTE  was born 1602 in Of Shalford, Essex, England, and died DEAD.	
2 CONT 	xii.	Samuel FOOTE  was born 1603 in Shalford, Essex, England, and died AFT 1665 in Providence, Providence, Rhode Island.	
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT  Marriage 2 Mrs Elizabeth FOOTE 
2 CONT Married: AFT 1600\\
2 CONT
