2 CONC ard's Eastcheap, London, Eng, daughter of John Brooke and Elizabeth Wetman. She was born June 18, 1559 in London, England, and died October 10, 1634 in St Leonard's Parish, London, England. She was a member of the leatherseller co
2 CONC mpany of London.   He was the brother of John Foote of London, and the father of Nathaniel Foote "The Settler."  							
