2 CONT
2 CONT     off the Iland and to take the names of all such as transport cattell, the day
2 CONT
2 CONT     of the month when, the number of the Generall Cattel, with there severall ear
2 CONT
2 CONT     marks and if any have cattel that have not their own eare marke or that have
2 CONT
2 CONT     other markes than ther owen the survayers are hereby required to make stopp of
2 CONT
2 CONT     them, unless thay give satisfaction to the survayers how they cam by those
2 CONT
2 CONT     Cattel, so differently marked. and the survayeers are to see the Cattell boated
2 CONT
2 CONT     and if any carry cattell off the ILand in the night, though survayed before,
2 CONT
2 CONT     shall have a survayer to see them at ther going of shore or shall forfeit
2 CONT
2 CONT     tenn pounds and stand to further sensuer of the toune".
2 CONT
