2 CONT
2 CONT     out the rest of time of him and after a while I married a wife whose maiden
2 CONT
2 CONT     name was Mary Paine. I being about thirty or twenty eight years old or
2 CONT
2 CONT     thereabouts, and the Lord hath given us eleven children of when one is dead. The
2 CONT
