2 CONT Biography of John Tripp []
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT John Tripp baptised 8 Sep 1611 Horkstow Lincolnshire Eng. He  prob arr 1635 in Portsmouth Newport Co RI. He m RI 1639 Mary Paine 1615-1667 dau of Anthony Paine and Susanna (Alice) Potter
2 CONT
2 CONT John Tripp, probably living in or near Newport, RI was one of about 100 purchasers of Conanicut Island from the Indians in 1657. His 350 year old signature can be seen on the original purchase agreement page at http://jamestownhis
2 CONC toricalsociety.org.whsites.net/jhs1/index.php?page_id=54
2 CONT
