2 CONT * no known relationship to https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Howard,_1st_Duke_of_Norfolk. His only son & heir was https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Howard,_2nd_Duke_of_Norfolk.
