2 CONT === Disputed Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Unknown-589385
2 CONT
2 CONT A Martha Potter was christened Oct 18, 1611 at St. Bride, Fleet Street, City of London, England, daughter of a George Potter.[1] As there is zero evidence from quality, reliable sources it is unclear why it has been presumed that 
2 CONC this Martha, wife of Thomas Hazard, is the Martha baptized in London in 1611.
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha's origins are unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha married Thomas Hazard about 1628.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She died sometime after the birth of her youngest child, Martha, who was born about 1642 and before her Husband remarried in 1675.[3]
2 CONT
