0 @I6000000001713398771@ INDI
1 NAME Thomas /Hazard/ "Progenitor of the Hazard Family- USA"
2 GIVN Thomas
2 SURN Hazard
2 NSFX "Progenitor of the Hazard Family- USA"
2 _MARNM Hazard
2 NICK Hazzard
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BET SEP 1609 AND SEP 1610
2 PLAC Possibly Dorset, or 
2 ADDR
3 CITY Orset
3 STAE England
1 OCCU unknown
2 DATE 1640
1 BURI
2 DATE 1680
2 ADDR
3 STAE Newport
3 CTRY Rhode Island
1 DEAT
2 DATE BET 1680 AND 24 SEP 1697
