2 CONC n Portsmouth and house, orchard, etc., all belong to Thomas Hazard for life and at the decease of Thomas Hazard to be for Thomas Sheriff and wife Martha for their lives, and at the death of both of them to to second son, John Sher
2 CONC iff and heirs, and want of issue of John to go to the third, Caleb Sheriff, etc."
