2 CONT * Son of Daniel WILCOX &  Esabell Pastorn
2 CONT
2 CONT * Christing Record:  [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/5166553484460020304?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000081491948911&position=0 '''12 Feb 1603 in South Elkington, Lincolnshire, England''']
