2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married:  (1) [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/5166553484460020304?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000081492558038 '''Mary Halgarthe'''] on 3 Jun 1629 in Farlesthorpe, Lincoln, England.  They also had a son named Daniel Wil
2 CONC cox.  Edward Wilcox was baptized February 12, 1603/4 at South Elkington, Linconshire, England, as the son of "Danyell Wylcock".[1]. He married first Mary, who died in childbirth and was buried June 27, 1630, at Croft, Linconshire,
2 CONC  England, Their son, Daniel, born in 1630 was buried in September, 1630 in Croft as well.[1].
2 CONT * Married: (2) [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/5166553484460020304?album_type=photos_of_me&end=&photo_id=6000000173104362867&project_id=&start=&tagged_profiles= '''Susannah THOMPSON,'''] daughter of Amos THOMPSON and Carynthaphuc
2 CONC h JACKSON, on 12 May 1631 in Orby, Lincolnshire, England. Susannah was born 6 Sep 1607 in Orby, Lincolnshire, England. She died in Rhode Island. When they married, Susanna, age 23 years, 8 months and 6 days, and Edward Wilcox, age
2 CONC  31 years, son of: John Wilcox, were married on Monday, 12 MAY 1631 at Orby, County of Lincolnshire, England.1.  Edward married second Susanna Thompson May 12, 1631, at Orby, Linconshire, England. Edward and Susanna had two known 
2 CONC children, both baptized at Croft, LIncolnshire, England:[1]
2 CONT
