2 CONT (2) 1642: Granted 20 acre lot #14 laid out on west side of Back River, Dover, NH. Bounded on south by William HILTON, on north by Samuel HAYNES. Later owned by John DREW.
2 CONT
2 CONT (2) 1642, 28 Jul: Administration of estate of John PHILLIPS given to Elders NUTTER and STARBUCK to pay the debts.
