2 CONT ! Birth: (1) Catherine REYNOLDS. (2) Katherine. No documentary evidence to show she was a REYNOLDS. (4) Eunice or Catherine REYNOLDS. Said to be from Wales.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage to Edward STARBUCK: (1,2,3)
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: (2) Living 19 Jun 1678. (3) No record of her death on Nantucket or the mainland.
2 CONT
2 CONT (2) 1653, Jul: Signed with husband Edward Starbuck.
2 CONT
2 CONT (2) 1659: In a deed, Mr. Broughton excepted the house and land on Newichawannock River of Goodwife Starbuck's, "being formerly given her," ... "in wife's right."
2 CONT
2 CONT (3) There is no record of her having moved to Nantucket.
2 CONT
2 CONT (3a) 1678, 19 Jun: Edward and Katherine Starbuck signed a deed for land in Dover, NH.
