1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Bartholomew West is the son of Matthew West. The name of his mother is unknown.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1651 Bartholomew purchased 70 acres in Portsmouth, Rhode Island. He and his brother Robert were among the original purchases of land in Monmouth County, East Jersey, in 1665 and he was a deputy from Shrewsbury to the General As
2 CONC sembly of East Jersey in 1667.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT 1652 to Catherine Almy
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Bartholomew and Catherine (Almy) West, born probably at Portsmouth, Rhode Island:[1]
2 CONT Stephen, b. circa 1654, m. 1682 Mercy Cooke, d. 12 August 1748 at Dartmouth, Massachusetts
2 CONT Audry, m. Thomas Webley of Shrewsbury
2 CONT William, m. Margaret Wardell widow of Ephraim Allen, d. 1745-46
2 CONT John, b. circa 1660, m. at Shrewsbury 15 October 1694 Jane Wing, d. circa January 1728 at Shrewsbury
2 CONT Bartholomew, b. after 1655, d. ? In Katherine's father's will of 28 February 1676/7, he gave to "'my grandchild Bartholomew West' £20 when he comes to age."[2] He did not apply to get land with his siblings Stephen, William, and A
2 CONC udrey in 1675, but he was still too young at 20. Are there any additional records of him?
2 CONT Unable to find a source for the relationship if any to Anne (West) Wooley (abt.1670-), connected as a daughter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death and Legacy
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert died before 1675, when his widow, who had already remarried, received a patent for their land.
2 CONT
2 CONT Katherin Brown "Late Widow of Bartholomew West […] in Right of her Deceased husband and her self from the Year 1666" received a warrant for 180 acres of land in Shrewsbury dated 2 Nov 1675.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Adopted this profile. Former DOD was 30 Oct 1703 but that can't be correct, as his wife was a widow by 1675.
2 CONT
2 CONT Could not find a will abstract for Bartholomew,[4] so not sure where the DOD came from; Ancestry cites "family data collection".
2 CONT
2 CONT Bartholomew was born about 1627. He passed away about 1674.
2 CONT
2 CONT
