2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Bartholomew West (abt. 1630 - bef. 1675) 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Bartholomew West===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born about 1630 in England
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Matthew West and Unknown (UNKNOWN) West [uncertain]
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of John West [half], Nathaniel West Sr. [half], Robert West and Joan (West) Coggeshall
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Katherine (Almy) Brown — married 1652 (to before 1675) [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Stephen West, William West, John West, Audrey (West) Webley and Anne (West) Wooley
2 CONT
2 CONT Died before 2 Nov 1675 in Shrewsbury, Monmouth, Province of East Jersey
2 CONT
2 CONT
