2 CONT ''Ensign'' '''John Whitman''' was born before 7 January 1598 in England.1 He was baptized on 7 January 1598 in Holt, Norfolk, England.1 and died  on 13 November 1692 in Weymouth, Province of Massachusetts Bay, now Norfolk County.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents:  son of Abiah Whitman and Alice (?).1'' n.b. some sources have Zachariah Whitman''.
