2 CONT '''Vital Statistics'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * His will names his wife as  Alice, last name unknown
2 CONT *  Besides his wife, the other relatives named in his will were:
2 CONT # oldest son John
2 CONT # second son Thomas
2 CONT #  third son Israel
2 CONT # youngest sons Isaac and Nathaniel
2 CONT # his daughter Elizabeth
2 CONT # his brother Walter Deane
2 CONT
2 CONT == Children ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John and Alice based on TAG article cited below:
2 CONT
2 CONT # John born 1639, first child born in Taunton; died Feb. 1717; married Nov. 7, 1663, Sarah Edson of Bridgewater.[2]
2 CONT # Thomas born ___; will proved July 15, 1697; married January 5, 1669-70, Katharine Stephens.[2]
2 CONT # Israel born ___; died unmarried; will date Aug. 7, 1677.[2]
2 CONT # Isaac born ___; will proved April 11, 1710; married Jan. 24, 1677-8, Hannah Leonard.[2]
2 CONT # Nathaniel born ___; died without issue betwen 1660 and 1667.[2]
2 CONT # Elizabeth born about 1650; died aged 84 in 1734; married Josiah Edson of Bridgewater. [12] [13][2] 
2 CONT
