2 CONT 4William Deane b. 1574 ENG. d. Oct 11, 1634 ENG m. Margaret Wickham. Ten children: William Deane b. 1600; John Deane b. 1601 d. April 25, 1660 m. Alice Strong (1635-37) [See the Will of John Deane of Taunton at the following hyper
2 CONC link: http://www.mayflowerfamilies.com/wills/john_deane.htm  ch= Thomas Deane m. Catherine Stevens d. of Thomas Stevens] Joane Deane b. 1602 d. bef. 1634; Thomas b. 1604 d. aft. 1634; Susan Deane b. 1606 d.. aft.1634; Isaac b. 160
2 CONC 8 d. aft.1634; Margerie Deane b. 1610 d. 1635 m. John Strong (son of Richard John Strong & Eleanor Deane); Walter (see below); Ellianor Deane b. 1614 d. aft. 1634; Elizabeth Deane b. abt. 1616 d. aft.1634. may be the Elizabeth Dea
2 CONC ne Twinning, whose son, William Twinning married Anne Doane (daughter of Deacon John Doane)  
2 CONT --------------------
