1 NAME Mary /Martin/
2 GIVN Mary
2 SURN Martin
2 _MARNM Leonard
2 NICK Mary Martin
2 NICK Margaret Jennie
2 NICK Mary Jane
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1619
2 ADDR
3 CITY Pontypool, Torfaen
3 STAE Wales
1 BURI
2 DATE 1664
