2 CONT The following notes are copied from RootsWeb.com WorldConnect -- Ancestry of Bob and Mary Beth Wheeler:
2 CONT "Was Elizabeth daughter of John Stone? See NEHGS "Register," Vol 6, pg. 341, Hardy & Haskell where    Roger Haskell calls John Stone his father-in-law & Elizabeth, widow of Roger, md. ____ Hardy. No, there seems to be a common mis
2 CONC understanding because of this statement of Roger's - John Stone was actually his stepfather, his mother's second husband, per "Chronicles of the Haskell Family," Ira J. Haskell, 1943. Elinor, widow of William, married John Stone a
2 CONC nd Elizabeth Hardy, daughter of John, married Roger Haskell.  Elizabeth died 1676, per Torrey, pg. 65."
