2 CONT # John Smith b: 28 AUG 1670 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts
2 CONT # Sarah Smith b: ABT 1667 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts
2 CONT # Mary Smith b: ABT 1669 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts
2 CONT # Elizabeth Smith b: ABT 1671 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts
2 CONT # Elizabeth Smith b: 08 AUG 1672 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts
