2 CONT Margaret Perry Freeman 1623–1688 m Edmond Freeman, Jr. in 1651
2 CONT Anthony Perry 1624–1683
2 CONT Rev Ezra Perry 1625–1689
2 CONT Edward Perry 1630–1695 m Mary Freeman abt. 1653 a Quaker, immigrated in 1639
2 CONT Hannah Perry Dillingham 1632–1673 m Henry Dillingham in 1652
2 CONT Deborah Perry Harper m Robert Harper in 1654
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' 8x all born in Sandwich 
