1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Ruth
2 CONT * Born 1628 in Essex, England
2 CONT *Died about 1706 in Sandwich, Barnstable Co., MA
2 CONT *Wife of William Swift
2 CONT *Mother of Hannah (Swift) Tobey, Ruth Swift, William Swift, Ephraim Swift, Maria Swift, Samuel Swift, Jirah Swift, Hester (Swift) Gibbs, Temperance (Swift) Bourne, Josiah Swift and Dinah (Swift) Perry
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT Some say she was a daughter of Mary Cooke (and John Tomson/Thompson, a Tobey, Dillingham, Ellingham, Morse or Arnold all without source. Published 21st century researchers Robert Charles Anderson and Jane Fletcher Fiske both admit
2 CONC  no knowledge of her surname.
2 CONT
2 CONT Seen as daughter of https://www.geni.com/people/Francis-Tobey/6000000008906400087?through=6000000000218967233 & https://www.geni.com/people/Mary-Tobey/6000000011800503195?through=6000000000218967233
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT She was born about 1628 in England and died 1706 in Sandwich, Barnstable, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married William Swift about 1645 in MA, son of William Swift and Joan ____. An unsourced marriage date of 18 Nov 1650 in Sandwich, Massachusetts, has been suggested.
2 CONT
2 CONT Published 21st century researchers Robert Charles Anderson and Jane Fletcher Fiske both admit no knowledge of her surname.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Disputed Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT Some say she was a daughter of Mary Cooke (and John Tomson/Thompson, a Tobey, Dillingham, Ellingham, Morse or Arnold all without source. Published 21st century researchers Robert Charles Anderson and Jane Fletcher Fiske both admit
2 CONC  no knowledge of her surname.
2 CONT
