2 CONC :53; Bassett-Preston 7; Pope's Pioneers; MD 11:152, 12:243; McCormick-Hamilton 469} p. 1202. PITTS, Peter (-1692?) & Mary (ANDREWS)[HODGES], w. William; soon aft 2 Apr 1654; Taunton {Reg. 51:455, 52:16, 60:313, 62:282; Paine 1:45;
2 CONC  Taunton 1:31; Hodges 71-3; Babbitt 30; Bassett-Preston 7; Williams (#18) 52; Munsey-Hopkins 56} Abridgement of the Genealogical Record of The Hodges Family of New England, ending December 21, 1954, Compiled by George F Hodges and
