1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hannah LAKE - b. Jul. 3, 1621, North Benfleet, Essex, England; d. after 1675, Stonington, New London Co., CT. Arrived in America with her mother by 1635. Daughter of John LAKE and Margaret READE.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John and Hannah Gallup
2 CONT
2 CONT See Notable Cousins for lines to: George Horace GALLUP and Emily DICKINSON.
2 CONT
2 CONT # Hannah - b. Sep. 14, 1644, Boston, Suffolk Co., MA; 1721, CT. She was married on Jun. 18, 1672 in Norwich, New London Co., CT to Stephen GIFFORD (1641-1724). Children of Hannah and Stephen GIFFORD: John; Ruth; Stephen; and Aquil
2 CONC la.
2 CONT
2 CONT # John - b. Sep. 14, 1646, Boston, Suffolk Co., MA; d. Apr. 14, 1735, Stonington, New London Co., CT. He was married in 1674 in Ipswich, Essex Co., MA to his first cousin Elizabeth HARRIS, daughter of Thomas HARRIS and Martha LAKE
2 CONC . Children of John and Elizabeth GALLUP: John married Elizabeth WHEELER; Thomas; Martha; Samuel; Elizabeth; Nathaniel married his first cousin Margaret GALLUP (daughter of Benadam GALLUP and Esther PRENTICE); William; and Benjamin
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT # Esther - Mar. 24, 1652, Boston, Suffolk Co., MA; d. Taunton, Plymouth Co., MA. The Hodges genealogy gives her birth date as 21 Jul. 1653. She was married on Dec. 17, 1674 in Boston, Suffolk Co., MA to Henry HODGES (b. 1652; d. S
2 CONC ep. 30, 1717, Taunton, Plymouth Co., MA. Children of Esther and Henry HODGES: Mary; Esther; William; Charity; Henry; Benjamin; John; Joseph married Bethiah WILLIAMS; Elizabeth; and Abigail.
2 CONT
2 CONT # Benadam - b. 1655, Stonington, New London Co., CT; b. Aug. 2, 1727, Stonington, New London Co., CT; bur. Whitehall Cem., Mystic, CT. He was married in 1682 in Boston, Suffolk Co., MA to Esther PRENTICE (b. Jul. 20, 1660, New Lon
2 CONC don Co., CT; d. May 17, 1751, Stonington, New London Co., CT; bur. Whitehall Cem., Mystic, CT), daughter of John PRENTICE and Esther NICHOLS. Children of Benadam and Esther GALLUP: Hannah married William WHEELER; Esther married Jo
2 CONC seph STANTON; Mercy married William DENISON; Thomas married Love; Mercy married William DENISON; Benadam married Eunice COBB; Joseph married Eunice WILLIAMS; Margaret married her first cousin Nathaniel GALLUP (son of John GALLUP a
2 CONC nd Elizabeth HARRIS); and Lucy.
2 CONT
2 CONT # William - b. 1658, Stonington, New London Co., CT; b. May 15, 1731, Stonington, New London Co., CT; bur. Whitehall Cem., Mystic, CT. He was married on Jan 4, 1683/4 in Stonington, New London Co., CT to Sarah CHESEBROUGH (b. Dec.
2 CONC  24, 1663; d. Sep. 9, 1729, Stonington, New London Co., CT; bur. Whitehall Cem., Mystic, CT, daughter of Samuel CHESEBROUGH & Abigail INGRAHAM. Children of William and Sarah GALLUP: Sarah; John married Prudence HAYWARD/HOWARD; Wil
2 CONC liam; Mary; Hannah; and Temperence.
2 CONT
2 CONT # Christobel - b. 1658, Stonington, New London Co., CT. She was married on Dec. 31, 1677 in Stonington, New London Co., CT to Peter CRARY (d. 1708). Children of Christobel and Peter CRARY: Christobel; Peter; Margaret; John; Willia
2 CONC m; Robert; Hannah.
2 CONT
2 CONT # Samuel - b. 1664, Stonington, New London Co., CT; d. before Jul. 9, 1731.
2 CONT
2 CONT # Elizabeth - b. Mar. 8, 1662/3, Stonington, New London Co., CT; d. 1726, Westerly, Washington Co., RI. Married Henry STEVENS.
2 CONT
2 CONT # Mary - b. 1664, Stonington, New London Co., CT. She was married in 1687 in Boston, Suffolk Co., MA to John COLE (b. Feb. 14, 1651/2, Middletown, Middlesex Co., CT), son of Henry COLE and Sarah RUSCO. Children of Mary and John CO
2 CONC LE: Samuel; Thomas; and Mary.
2 CONT
2 CONT #  Margaret - Married Joseph CULVER. 
2 CONT
