2 CONT @R1503248714@  U.S. and Canada, Passenger and Immigration Lists Index, 1500s-1900s  Ancestry.com  Ancestry.com Operations, Inc  1,7486::0 Place: Massachusetts; Year: 1634; Page Number: 12  1,7486::4246794
