2 CONC ounty, Connecticut, WithBiographical Sketches of Many of Its Pioneers and Prominent Men''. Philadelphia: J. W. Lewis & Co., 1882. p 478. [Digital copy available at[https://archive.org/details/historyofnewlond00hurd Internet Archiv
2 CONC e.]]* Torrey, Clarence Almon.  ''New England Marriages Prior to 1700, Vol.1, New England Historic Genealogical Society, Boston, 2011, p. 595. GALLUP, John (1618-1675) & Hannah [LAKE] (1621-); ca 1643; Boston/New London, CT.
2 CONT
