2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Bodfish, daughter of Robert and Bridget Bodfish of Sandwich, married John Crocker, son of Deacon William and Alice Crocker, in Nov. 1659.[1][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She died Dec. 1662.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth born Oct. 7, 1660;[3][4] died Jan. 15, 1716; married Deacon Richard Child in 1678.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan born July 15, 1662;[3] married Hannah Howland, daughter of John Howland, on May 20, 1686.[4] He died on Aug. 24, 1746, buried at West Barnstable.[1]
2 CONT
