2 CONT * 4.0 4.1 4.2 The New England Historical and Genealogical Register, Volume 2, by Henry Fritz-Gilbert Waters, New England Historic Genealogical Society, 1848
2 CONT *See also: A GENEALOGICAL MEMOIR OF THE LO-LATHROP FAMILY-1884, PAGE 49, SAMUEL (#36)
