2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/surnames/annabel Annabel]
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/surnames/besse Besse] (her 1st husband's surname)
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/surnames/bessey Bessey] (a variation of her 1st husband's surname)
2 CONT
