2 CONT As a ships carpenter and member of the crew, he is believed to have voyaged to Ameria first about 1621 and again in 1624, when he remained a year, a third time in 1631 when he stayed at Cape Ann for an uncertain period, finally co
2 CONC ming to Sandwich, Ma.in 1637 where he settled and remained until hi death.
