3 CTRY Latvia
1 OCCU Krigskommissarie
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *
2 CONT Hans blev slået til ridder som Lord Cronman af Christina, dronning af Sverige den 9. marts 1638.
2 CONT **
2 CONT Hans Cronman (Detterman) (1590-ca. 1645) was the war commissar (kriegskommissär) for the Swedish Empire, and he was Lord of Alatskivi in Swedish Livonia. (b. 1590; Swedish Livonia - d. after February 9, 1645; Riga, Latvia)
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: He married Ursula Kordes (1600–1675) around 1615.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: Anrep and later Elgenstierna list the children as: Vilhelm Hansson Cronman (c1617-1656); Johan Hansson Cronman (1618-?); Anna Catharina Cronman I (1620-?); Fritz Hansson Cronman (c1621-c1680); Christina Hansdatter Cronma
2 CONC n (c1625–1687) who married Joakim George Fredrick von Rohr (c1625–1687); Elisabet Hansdatter Cronman (1630-1687); Joakim Hansson Cronman (1635-1707) who married Lunetta Makeléer (1639-1693) on August 9, 1657 or 1659 in Goteborg, S
2 CONC weden; Frans Hansson Cronman (c1636-?); Christina Hansdatter Cronman (c1637-1679); Ursula Hansdatter Cronman (c1638-c1688).
2 CONT
2 CONT Noble family 748: Adliga ätter von Cronmann nr 748 :Hans Detterman , knighted 1642 as von Cronmann (von Cronman), till Elkcderf i Tugiska kretsen , som han erhöll genom drottningen Christinas brev 1638. Borgare in Riga. Krigskomis
2 CONC sarien. Hans von Cronman är introduserad i Riddarehuset i Riga, Latvia, och Hans Cronmans efter- generationes med oliga numrer i Stockholm, Sverige. Died Oeka, (Oeka lied nowadays in Latvia, near Riga). Lord of Alatskivi in Swedis
2 CONC h Livonia. War comissar, Krigskommissarien. Died at Oegan, close Riga, Latvia.  Familyname has been written also as follows: Cronmann, Krohnemann, Kronemann, Detterman , Dettermann, etc. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Links:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://runeberg.org/anrep/1/0500.html
