1 NOTE {geni:about_me} == ALBERT MACDOUGAL (aka ALBREKT DUWALL) ==
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Contrary to what is suggested by the surname used here, Albert MacDougal, here treated, is not a member of [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clan_MacDougall Clan MacDougal]'''</blockquote>
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Albrecht MacDougall was the son of Patrick MacDougall of Mackerston and Margaret Nisbet. Albrecht served as a sheriff (befallningsman) for Örby and environs by 1615, having arrived in Sweden in 1594. On 24 November 1615 he sign
2 CONC ed a receipt for salt. Later an Albrekt Macdougal, probably the same man, served as first captain in Henrik Fleming's Karelia regiment, and in 1625 he was captain in Gustaf Horn's Savolaks regiment. He was the father of nine sons 
2 CONC and three daughters. Of these we can identify his sons Jacob MacDougall, Tobias Macdougall, Axel MacDougall and Maurits MacDougall, albeit only Jacob and Maurits are found in Elgenstierna. Albrecht was ennobled as Duwall and died 
2 CONC in 1641. Albrecht had a brother, Robert MacDougall who followed him abroad in the 1590s and established a family in Sweden including Albrecht's nephew, William MacDougall. [https://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/history/ssne/item.php?id=244
2 CONC 4 Univesity of St. Andrews: Institute of Scottish Historical Research]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Genealogy ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''[https://www.st-andrews.ac.uk/history/ssne/item.php?id=2444 Univesity of St. Andrews: Institute of Scottish Historical Research]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT == Research Notes ==
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Duwall_nr_241 '''Albrekt MacDougall'''], (son till Patrick MacDougall of Mackerstone och Margaret Nisbet), född 1541 i Mackerston, Skottland; inkom till Sverige som legosoldat omkring 1594 och
2 CONC  var fogde i Tierp 1610-17; † 1641. '''Gift 1:o''' med Maria N.N. '''Gift 2:o''' med Catharina von Bredow, dotter till Hans von Bredow och Elisbeth von Plessen. '''Gift 3:o''' med Ursila von Stralendorf, † 1651, från Mecklenburg (
2 CONC källa: Svenskt Biografiskt Lexikon. XI (10/1 1945).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clan_MacDougall Wikipedia: Clan MacDougal]
