1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jerzy_Mniszech
2 CONT
2 CONT http://pl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jerzy_Mniszech
2 CONT
2 CONT <<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<<
2 CONT
2 CONT The 16th century Polish Nobility http://www.almanachdegotha.org/id221.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Coat of arms	Mniszech or Konczyc or Poraj1 Consort	Jadwiga Tarło Issue
2 CONT
2 CONT Urszula Mniszech; Marina Mniszech; Eufrozyna Mniszech; Mikołaj Mniszech; Stanisław Bonifacy Mniszech; Stefan Jan Mniszech; Franciszek Bernard Mniszech; Noble family	Mniszchowie; Father	Mikołaj z Wielkich Kuńczyc; Mother	Wracimowa 
2 CONC Mniszech; Born	Abt. 1548; Died	May 16, 1613;
2 CONT
2 CONT Jerzy Mniszech (c. 1548 – 1613) was a nobleman (szlachcic) in the Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth. Member of the Mniszchowie family. Krajczy koronny in 1574, castellan of Radom in 1583, voivode of Sandomierz Voivodship in 1590, żup
2 CONC nik ruski, starost of Lwów in 1593, starost of Sambor, Sokal, Sanock, Rohatyn.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Marina Mniszech (c. 1588—1614). Dealt with providing courtisans for the courts of some Commonwealth magnates. He is known for meddling in the Muscovy Times of Troubles, as he wed his daughter Marina to the False Dmitri I
2 CONC  and later convinced her to marry the False Dmitri II.
2 CONT
2 CONT He had several other children. His daughter Urszula Mniszech, born in 1603, married prince Konstanty Wisniowiecki, voivode of Russia (1564–1641). Anna Mniszech married Piotr Szyszkowski, castellan of Wojno. Eufrozyna Mniszech marr
2 CONC ied Hermolaus Jordan. Mikołaj Mniszech (1587–1613) became starosta łukowski and Stanisław Bonifacy Mniszech (?-1644) became starosta lwowski 1613, samborski, gliniański; married (1602/1603) Zofia ks. Hołowczyńska. Stefan Jan Mnisz
2 CONC ech became starost of Sanok. Franciszek Bernard Mniszech became castellan sądecki in 1638, starost sanocki i szczyrzycki, married Barbara ze Żmigrodu Stadnicka.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jerzy Mniszech is one of the personas on the painting by Jan Matejko: Kazanie Skargi (The Sermon of Piotr Skarga).
2 CONT
2 CONT http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jerzy_Mniszech
