1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === John   Brooke 
2 CONT *Birth:   1540, Of,London,London,England 
2 CONT *Christening:   Unknown 
2 CONT *Death:  St. Leonard East,London,London,England
2 CONT * Burial:   St. Leonard East,London,London,England 
