1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Helen Warren, born about 1527 in Bassingbourn, Cambridge, England, was the daughter of Richard Warren and his wife Alice, and sister to a brother also named Richard Warren.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Helen Warren or Waller, b. ca. 1529, m. (1) John Foote, (2) 19 Jan. 1558/9 John Hall (see TAG 54:100). Her son John Foote was named in the will of her brother Richard Warren," [7] and also according to George E. McCraken, in Nath
2 CONC aniel Foote's English Relatives (TAG 53:193).“Helen married 2nd, on 19 Jan 1558 in England, to John Hall Sgt trumpeter to Queen Elizabeth.”
2 CONT
2 CONT Her children were Aves Foote, Robert Foote, John Foote and Elizabeth Foote
2 CONT
