2 CONT *http://www.footefamily.org/john_royston.html
2 CONT *The American Genealogist. New Haven, CT: D. L. Jacobus, 1937-. (Online database. AmericanAncestors.org. New England Historic Genealogical Society, 2009 - .) More on Nathaniel Foote's Ancestors by Janice Greene Valore, Vol. 54, pa
2 CONC ge 99-101.
2 CONT *The American Genealogist. New Haven, CT: D. L. Jacobus, 1937-. (Online database. AmericanAncestors.org. New England Historic Genealogical Society, 2009 - .) Ancestors of Nathaniel Foote -- Warren Line, by Myrtle Stevens Hyde. Vol
2 CONC . 58, page 165-167.
2 CONT *The American Genealogist. New Haven, CT: D. L. Jacobus, 1937-. (Online database. AmericanAncestors.org. New England Historic Genealogical Society, 2009 - .) Nathaniel Foote's English Relatives, by George E. McCraken. Vol. 53, pag
2 CONC e 193-206.
