2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for ROBERT FOOTE: American Genealogist calls him John Foote.
2 CONT
2 CONT John Foote of Royston was one of our oldest confirmed ancestors. He was born about the year 1530 in the town of Royston, Hertfordshire, England.. He owned a small manor house along with some land in the town. John was the father o
2 CONC f Robert Foote of Shalford, and the Grand Father of Nathaniel Foote the Settler. John died before. January 1558/59 in Royston, , Hertfordshire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: Parish records show that in the year 1548 John was married to Helen or Ellen Warren_(Waryn) the daughter of Richard Warren and Alice Jenway in Hertfordshire, England. She was born Abt. 1529 in Bassingbourn, Cambridgshire
2 CONC , Eng. Her death was recorded at St. Leonard,N/E Chapel, London,England.
2 CONT
2 CONT John Foote died before 18 Jul 1558. When the undated will of John Foote of Royston, Cambridgeshire, England, tallow chandler, was probated His will revealed that he had a wife named Helen, sons Robert and John, and daughters Aves 
2 CONC or Avis (Alice) and Elizabeth. The will also alluded to the testator's brother Foote, first name not stated and his two older children.
2 CONT
2 CONT He left to the church of Royston, 20s; 
2 CONT
2 CONT • To wife Helen, all lands and tenements in Royston for life; and L80 to be divided among all the children;
2 CONT
2 CONT • To servant Maud Smythe L6/13/4 to her marriage;
2 CONT
2 CONT L3 that my brother Foot oweth to his two eldest children;
2 CONT
2 CONT • To wife's brother Richard Warren the younger and to her uncle John Jenawaye of Stoone, 40s each;
2 CONT
2 CONT • To wife the rest;
2 CONT
2 CONT • To son Robert a goblet, feather bed and bedding;
2 CONT
2 CONT • To son John Foot a silver salt, feather bed and bedding;
2 CONT
2 CONT • To Aves Foote and Elizabeth Foote, daughters, each three of the best spoons, bed and bedding;
2 CONT
2 CONT All the remainder to wife named executrix.
2 CONT
2 CONT Witness
2 CONT
2 CONT • William Meede, citizen and grocer of London;
2 CONT
2 CONT • John Jenaway,
2 CONT
2 CONT • Nicholas Warreyn of Bassingbourn
2 CONT
2 CONT • Richard Warreyn of Bassingbourn.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Links 
2 CONT *http://www.footefamily.org/john_royston.html
