1 NOTE Name: Helen WARREN Surname: Warren Given Name: Helen Sex: F Birth: 1527/1529 in Of Bassingbourn, Cambridgeshire, England Death: AFT Jul 1558/1559 in London, Middlesex, England 
2 CONT Note: 
2 CONT Source: Google, From the files of Stephen M. Lawson Helen Warren - born about 1529. Daughter of Richard Warren (aka WALLER) of Bassingbourn, Cambridgeshire (b. about 1501; will dated Mar. 28, 1557, p]roved May 2, 1557) and Alice (
2 CONC probably sister of John Jenawaye). Helen was the sister of Richard (married Beatrice). Nicholas, Henry (married and had daughter), Alice (likely married Richard Frende), and William (Married Margaret Painter, and had daughters Ali
2 CONC ce and Elizabeth). Helen (WARREN) FOOTE married second Jan 19, 1558/9, St. Peter Cornhill, London, John HALL, "sgt trumpeter to Queen Elizabeth." Record says she died at St. Leonard Chapel. Probably buried there.
2 CONT   Father: Richard WARREN  b: 1501 in Of Royston, Hertfordshire, England  Mother: Alice JENAWAYE b: 1505 in Of Bassingbourn, Cambridgeshire, England  Marriage 1 John FOOTE  b: 1523 in Of Royston, Hertfordshire, England 
2 CONT Married: ABT Jan 1548 in Of Royston, Hertfordshire, England
2 CONT Children 
2 CONT Alice FOOTE  b: 1549 in Royston, Hertfordshire, England 
2 CONT Nathaniel FOOTE  b: ABT 1551 in , , England 
2 CONT Robert Richard FOOTE  b: 1553 in Prob.Royston,Hertfordshire, England 
2 CONT Thomas FOOTE  b: 1555 in Of London, London, England 
2 CONT Elizabeth FOOTE  b: ABT 1557 in Of Royston, Hertfordshire, England 
2 CONT John FOOTE Jr .  b: 1558 in Shalford, Essex, England
2 CONT  Marriage 2 John HALL  
2 CONT Married: 19 Jan 1558/1559 in St. Peter Cornhill,London,England
1 NOTE "The Macomber Family", Harold Macomber, Ventura, CA 1981.
2 CONT THE AMERICAN GENEALOGIST V 58 1982 p 166 'Ancestors of Nathaniel Foote--Warren Line', by Myrtle Stevens Hyde.  "Helen WARREN is found to be the d/o Richard WARREN alias WALLER whose will was proved in 1557.  In the will he fails t
2 CONC o mention her or his son William, probably because both had received their portions."  p 167 "Helen Warren or Watter bca 1529 m/1 John FOOTE m/2 19 Jan 1558/9 John HALL.  Her son John Foote was named in the will of her brother Ric
2 CONC hard."
