2 CONT ''John Tripp, 1611 - 1678: A Glimpse into Our Founder's Life''. by Janet Tripp Andrews edited by Jan E. Tripp © November, 2016. < [https://portsmouthhistorical.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/11/John_Tripp_1611-1678_V11-10-16.pdf PDF]
2 CONC  >
