2 CONT Susannah THOMPSON, daughter of Amos THOMPSON and Carynthaphuch JACKSON, on 12 May 1631 in Orby, Lincolnshire, England. Susannah was born 6 Sep 1607 in Orby, Lincolnshire, England. She died in Rhode Island.
