1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Danyell Wylcock=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Christopher Wilcox and Alice Stephens 
2 CONT * Death: November 25, 1605 (36-44) in South Elkington, Lincolnshire, England  
2 CONT * [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/66605301/daniel-wilcox '''Danyell Wilcox - Find A Grave Memoria''']l
2 CONT * Place of Burial:	All Saints Churchyard South Elkington, East Lindsey District, Lincolnshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000003796674324?album_type=photos_of_me&end=&photo_id=6000000173156348862&project_id=&start=&tagged_profiles= '''Esabell Farnsworth;''']   Daniel married Isabel (Wilcox) in North Elk
2 CONC ington, Lincoln, Eng.  She married (1) Robert [Westorn or Pastorn] on Nov 16,1606; South Elkington, Lincoln, Eng and (2) to Danyell Wylcock.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Edward Wilcox'''  was baptized on 12 Feb 1603-1604 in South Elkington, Lincoln, Eng 4 and died before 1660 in Rhode Island. 
2 CONT * '''Thomas Wilcox'''  was born on 30 Nov 1589 in North Elkington, Lincoln, Eng 5 and died after 1645. 
2 CONT * '''Anne Wilcox''' was baptized on 1 Mar 1591/92 in South Elkington, Lincoln, Eng 4 and was buried on 30 Sep 1593 in South Elkington, Lincoln, Eng
2 CONT * '''Ellen Wilcox''' was born on 1 Sep 1584 in South Elkington, Lincoln, Eng 4 5 and was buried on 23 Apr 1599 in South Elkington, Lincoln, Eng
2 CONT *  '''Alis Wilcox''' was born about 1595 in South Elkington, Lincoln, Eng and was buried on 20 May 1597 in South Elkington, Lincoln, Eng 
2 CONT * '''Margaret Wilcox''' was baptized in Nov 1597 in South Elkington, Lincoln, Eng 4 and was buried on 6 Nov 1597 in South Elkington, Lincoln, Eng  
2 CONT *''' Francis Wilcox''' was baptized on 20 Dec 1598 in South Elkington, Lincoln, Eng
2 CONT * '''John Wilcox''' was baptized on 8 Aug 1602 in South Elkington, Lincoln, Eng 4 and was buried on 29 Nov 1602 in South Elkington, Lincoln, Eng 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * [http://www.jhow.org/genealogy/research/DaniellWylcock.pdf?PHPSESSID=d97d64a18c3394ba2be7f03640b0a745 Danielle Wylcock born about 1565 ... researched by Karl Weiler 18 Sept 2008]
2 CONT * http://dunhamwilcox.net/source_files/wilcox.htm
2 CONT
