2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Peter Coffin (1580 - 1628)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Joanna Coffin Hull (1602 - 1632)*
2 CONT   Tristram Coffin (1609 - 1681)*
