2 CONT
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert Stevens married circa 1585 to Dionis (last name unknown).  They may each have been married previously.  He died sometime between 16 Dec 1627 (date of his will) and 4 Feb 1627/8.
2 CONT His will mentions a messuage in Brixton called Slowe; sons Tristam, Thomas, William, John; wife "Dewence"; daughters "Dewence" and Lydia. 
2 CONT
