1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Edward-Starbuck-of-Nottingham/6000000179211396834
2 CONT * not the husband of https://www.geni.com/people/Anne-Starbuck/6000000000207097285?through=6000000002301084869
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT His ancestry and date of birth is unknown. Additionally, there is no proof that he married Anne Barnes. The marriage record of an Edward Starbuck and Anne Barnes on the date noted on this profile took place in Nottinghamshire. See
2 CONC : https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/collaborate/LZVG-3RX He has been detached from Anne Barnes. See G2G discussion.
2 CONT
2 CONT The christening of his son William in 1607 is recorded in the records of All Saints Church in Derby, Derbyshire.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT His son Edward's christening is also located there. Edward was christened at All Saints Church in Derby, Derbyshire in February 1603[2].
2 CONT
