2 CONT This information follows the research of others and confirmations by census and family tree info. ALL the info I have is on this database, however, I appreciate any corrections or additions.
1 NOTE From Ancestral File (TM), data as of 2 January 1996.
1 NOTE Hester Mahieu came over on the fourth ship called the "Little James."  Two ships left: the Anne and the Little James together for America, but were separated and arrived in Plymouth a week to ten days apart.
1 NOTE Came on the Ann, 1623, with her daughter Jane Cooke.
