2 CONC Walker was discovered.  In the will of Augustine Walker, dated April 1613, he mentions "my daughter Elizabeth Warren wife of Richard Warren", and "her three children Mary, Ann and Sarah."  We know that the Mayflower passenger's fi
2 CONC rst three children were named Mary, Ann, and Sarah (in that birth order).
