2 CONT All of Richard Warren's children survived to adulthood, married and had large families. It is claimed that Warren is the Mayflower passenger with most descendants, numbering over 14 million [10] including: President Ulysses S. Gra
2 CONC nt, President Franklin D. Roosevelt, former Alaska Governor Sarah Palin,[4] astronaut Alan Shepard, author Laura Ingalls Wilder (Little House on the Prairie series), actor Richard Gere, Lavinia Warren, also known as Mrs. Tom Thumb
2 CONC , [5] educator and poet Henry Wadsworth Longfellow,[6][7] and the Wright brothers.[1]
