2 CONT
2 CONT 1.on 14 April 1610 in Great Amwell, Hertfordshire, England to Elizabeth Walker, the daughter of Augustine Walker of Great Amwell, Hertford; she was baptised 1583 in Baldock, Hertfordshire, England and died October 2, 1673. [3] She
2 CONC  and his first five children, all daughters, came to America in the ship Anne in 1623. Once in America, they then had two sons before Richard's death in 1628.[1][2] •> marriage cited in The American Genealogist, Vol 78, no. 2, p. 
