1 NOTE Note:  One of the founders of Sandwich, when the land was granted by the Court of Assistants of the Plymouth Colony to New England.  He then returned to England [NEHGR 71:310-324; 78:391-395] aboard the "Abigail" with his wife, an
2 CONC d Annis aged 8 and Christopher aged 3. They traveled on this ship with John Winthrop. This was the second time that William had come to New England.
