2 CONT After the death of John Jenney Sarah became involved in several landtransactions that proved to be very sucessful, records of which can befound in the records of "Plymouth Colony" at Plymouth, Massachusetts. Shedied in 1655, after
2 CONC  making a will, that can also be found at Plymouth. Norecord of a burial place has been found.
