2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Name unknown.  Wife of RIchard Whitman, of Lee in Buckingham, England.  Children were John, Zachariah, and Elizabeth, who married 1) John or Thomas Streame 2) John Otis.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Robert Charles Anderson in the Great Migration, Immigrants to New England, 1634-1635 John1 Whitman of Weymouth, Zachariah1 Whitman of Dorchester, New Havan and Milford and Elizabeth1 (Whitman) [Stream] Otis are all ch
2 CONC ildren of Richard Whitman of Lee, Buckinghamshire, England.
