2 CONT The Life Summary of Eleanor
2 CONT
2 CONT Eleanor Cogan was born on 12 October 1609, in South Chard, Somerset, England as the daughter of William Cogan. She married Walter Dean in 1635, in Chard, Somerset, England, United Kingdom. They were the parents of at least 9 sons 
2 CONC and 10 daughters. She died on 20 August 1693, in Taunton, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 83.
