2 CONC e 303.  "MARTIN, Isaac.  A witness in a Hingham lawsuit in 1639.  Rehoboth, prop., 1643."
2 CONT * [http://www.usgennet.org/usa/ma/county/bristol/attleboro/rehobothset.htm "Rehoboth's First Proprietors"] 1643
2 CONT * http://www.usgennet.org/usa/ma/county/bristol/images/rehobcongchurch.jpg
2 CONT
