1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Sarah Elizabeth “Betts” Crowell? Perry=
2 CONT * BIRTH 1592 Devon, England
2 CONT * DEATH 8 Jun 1659 (aged 66–67) Sandwich, Barnstable County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Burial Details Unknown. Specifically: Barnstable County, Massachusetts 
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID  6343978  
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT Sarah Betts was born about 1592 in Devonshire, England. Many sources say her maiden name was Crowell, she was born in London and her parents were John Crowell and Elishua Miller. I don’t think so because John and Elishua were the 
2 CONC parents of Sarah’s daughter-in-law Elizabeth, her son Arthur’s wife. I am beginning to think that Sarah’s maiden name is really lost to history (See the discussion under her son Arthur Perry and daughter-in-law Elizabeth Crowell) 
2 CONT
2 CONT After Sarah Perry died, on 7 of June 1659, Plymouth Colony Court (Records, Vol. 3, p. 163) authorized Ezra Perry to serve as executor of the estate of the widow, Sarah Perry, “there being no other (although she hath many friends i
2 CONC n the Country) that claimeth any interest to the estate, having put in securities into the Court to be accountable for the estate in case it shall be required by any that hath better title thereto…” Ezra presented the inventory of
2 CONC  the estate the following day. An Inventory of Sarah Perry’s Estate (NOTE: On June 7, 1659, Ezra Perry was allowed by the court to be Executor of the estate of Sarah Perry. This inventory was taken the day after. Sarah Perry, who 
2 CONC is believed by many to have been the widow of Edmund Perry and mother of Ezra Perry above, apparently left no will.) 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Estate Inventory==
2 CONT An Inventory of the goods of Sara Pery of Sandwich lately deceassed taken and prissed [appraised] this 8 of June 1659 by them whose names are under written. l.-s.-d. [pounds-shillings-pence] 
2 CONT *Imprimise five Cowes at …………………………….. 17-00-0 
2 CONT *It on 2 yeare old steere ………………………………. 02-05-0 
2 CONT *It two yeare old Calves ………………………………. 03-00-0 
2 CONT *It 12 yards of sarge ……………………………………. 03-00-0 
2 CONT *It on chest with some Cotton wooll &, divers other smalle thinges …………………………………………….02-00-0 
2 CONT *The whole some …………………………………………..27-05-0.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT Some indicate John and Elishua Crowell immigrated to America, but do not list a daughter Sarah. There is another daughter Elizabeth who apparently marred an unknown Perry man.[3]  Another book states that John and Elishua Crow sta
2 CONC rted having children about 1615, which would indeed make Sarah as their daughter impossible.[4]  She is mentioned as being a Quaker. Sarah died 07 Jun 1659 in Sandwich, Barnstable, Mass. Children of Edmond and Sarah: 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Edmund Vassell Perry 1587–1659
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT John Perry 1612–1642
2 CONT Arthur Vassell Perry 1615–1652
2 CONT Margaret Perry Freeman 1623–1688
2 CONT Anthony Perry 1624–1683
2 CONT Rev Ezra Perry 1625–1689
2 CONT Ezra Perry 1625–1689
2 CONT Edward Perry 1630–1695
2 CONT Hannah Perry Dillingham 1632–1673
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendant Details
2 CONT *1. Arthur Perry 1614 Elizabeth Crow (Crowell) c. 1636 Boston, Mass. 9 Oct 1652Boston, Mass. 
2 CONT *2. John Perry 1616 Fremington, Devonshire, England Did not marry Anna Newman 1629 in Sawbridgeworth . Elizabeth [_?_] 21 Sep 1642Roxbury or Sherborn, Middlesex, Mass 
2 CONT *3. Thomas (William) Perry 1620Pulborough, Sussex, England Susannah Carver 1693 Sandwich, Barnstable, Mas 
2 CONT *4. Elizabeth Perry? (May be John Perry’s widow) 1622 Pulborough, Sussex, England John Hanchett 2 Apr 1644 or 2 Apr 1652 Roxbury, Suffolk, Mass. 5 Nov 1688 – Sandwich, Barnstable, Mass 
2 CONT *5. Hannah Perry 1623 Henry Dillingham (son of Edward DILLINGHAM) 24 June 1652. Sandwich, PC 9 Jan 1672/73 Sandwich, Barnstable Co. Mass
2 CONT *6. Anthony PERRY 1624 in Devonshire, England Elizabeth [?] about 1647 1 Mar 1682/83 Rehoboth, Mass 
2 CONT *7. Margaret Perry 1625 Edmond Freeman(Son of Edmund FREEMAN) 18 Jul 1651 
2 CONT *8. Ezra Perry 1627Bridford, Devonshire, England Elizabeth Burgess 12 Feb 1650/51 Sandwich, Barnstable, Ma 16 Oct 1689 Sandwich, Barnstable, MA 
2 CONT *9. Edward Perry 1630 Devonshire, England Mary Freeman(Daughter of Edmund FREEMAN) 1653 Sandwich, Mass 16 Feb 1694/95 Sandwich, Barnstable, Mass 
2 CONT *10. Deborah Perry 8 Nov 1635 Devonshire, England Robert Harper 09 May 1654 Sandwich, Barnstable Co, Mass 14 Oct 1665 Sandwich, Barnstable, Mass; 
