2 CONT >'''Despite speculators''' giving him a precise date of birth/baptism either in county Cornwall or in Hillmorton, Warwickshire, there is no viable source upon which to rely. 
2 CONT >'''Wikitree's online "source" no longer exists scrutiny.''' The URL to what was a PDF is now defunct at [https://dougsinclairsarchives.com/articles/burgesfamilyforwebsite.pdf DougSinclairArchivs.com]. Whether Sinclair was convinc
2 CONC ed his original writing was not accurate or that it needed further research and a rewriting is not known. — Ken Shelley 8 Feb 2025
