2 CONT * [https://memory.loc.gov/service/gdc/scd0001/2007/20070619037he/20070619037he.pdf link] to Henry Andrews of Taunton 
2 CONT *https://www.genealogy.com/ftm/m/y/e/Ron-C-Myers/GENE30-0050.html
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Source ===
2 CONT --------------------
