2 CONC on in 1638 and was admitted one of the first 7 freeman of Taunton on December 4.<ref name='Emery'>[[#Emery|Emery]]</ref> He was deputy to the General Court in 1639, the first year any were chosen, and was selected 1642-4, 1647 and
