2 CONT ----------child: Howland, John (1627 - )
2 CONT ----------child: Howland, Hope (1629 - 1684)
2 CONT ----------child: Howland, Elizabeth (1631 - )
2 CONT ----------child: Howland, Lydia (~1633 - )
2 CONT ----------child: Howland, Hannah (~1637 - )
2 CONT ----------child: Howland, Joseph (~1640 - )
2 CONT ----------child: Howland, Jabez (~1644 - )
2 CONT ----------child: Howland, Ruth (~1646 - )
