2 CONT topsail Halliards we hung overboard, and run out ye length, yet hekept his
2 CONT hold the seversl fathoms under water, till he was drawn up by ye ropeto ye
2 CONT surface and by a boat hook and other means, got into ye ship; and tho'somew't
