2 CONT  HOWLAND
2 CONT  John, Sen., Plymouth died 23 February 1672
2 CONT  John, son of Jabez, Plymouth, died January 1672
2 CONT # Change Date: 29 SEP 2003
1 NOTE RFN: 31850
1 NOTE John married Mary Walker on January 29, 1685.
2 CONT
2 CONT *according to the National Genealogical Society Quarterly's article on Henry Howland and his descendants it states that John died at Freetown before 8 Aug. 1687.  He seems not to have married.  It lists John as probably being the 
2 CONC 3rd born child of Henry and Mary
