2 CONT Elisabeth von Rosen, a.d.H. Allo is Charlemagne, Emperor of the West's 19th great granddaughter! http://www.geni.com/path/Charlemagne-Emperor-of-the-West+is+related+to+Elisabeth-von-Rosen-a-d-H-Allo?from=6000000002457013227&to=600
2 CONC 0000003366481932
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Elisabeth von Rosen, a.d.H. Allo - and - Frau von Uexküll - (end of her life von Rosen)!
2 CONT ===
2 CONT http://search.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/sse.dll?gl=ROOT_CATEGORY&rank=1&new=1&so=3&MSAV=1&msT=1&gss=ms_r_f-2_s&gsfn=Elisabeth&gsln=Von%20Rosen&msbdy=&msbpn__ftp=&msddy=&msdpn__ftp=&cpxt=0&catBucket=p&uidh=000&cp=0
2 CONT
2 CONT Reinhold d Olde von Yxkull-Guldenband was born in 1508, at sünnikoht. Reinhold married Elisabeth Reinholdsdotter von Üxkull till Felks (sündinud von Rosen a.d.H Allo (Ring)). Elisabeth was born hiljem kui 1523, in Allo, Estland.
