1 NOTE {geni:about_me} I suggest the following changes:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. The father of Tönnis Maydell was not a man with same name, but Johann Maydell, Ref. pp. 98-102 in the book "Das freiherrlide Geſchlecht von Maydell" (1868), https://archive.org/details/bub_gb_UiJMAQAAIAAJ/page/n5/mode/2up?vi...
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. That the first wife was Elisabeth von Rosen (Yxkull) is not mentioned in any older Maydell genealogies. The reference is also missing, so it does not seem justified. To the contrary, the thombstone of Jurgen Maydell shows coats
2 CONC  of arms of von Wrangell at the position where his mother's coats of arms should be (middle left). Thus, the mother of Tönnis Maydell's children waschildren was N․N․ von Wrangell․ She was possibly a daughter of Jurgen von Wrangell
2 CONC  here: https://www.geni.com/people/J%C3%BCrgen-von-Wrangell-a-Jesse-a-d-H-Tolks/6000000008779471519
2 CONT
2 CONT 3․ That the second wife was "Catharina Schnider" is a 300-year old misunderstaning․ The original document, from which this information is, has been read incorrectly (Genos, 95, 2/2014, p․ 97)․ The original, TLA․230․1․Ab․30, Ratspr
2 CONC otokolle 14 July 1602, shows that the widow of Tönnis Maydell was called Anna Holthusen․ https://www.geni.com/people/Anna-Holthausen/6000000011860634803․ She was apparently a sister of the mayor of Tallinn Johann Holthusen․
2 CONT
2 CONT Kind regards,
2 CONT Lasse Makkonen
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://brandt.slektforskning.se/T%C3%B6nnes-Maydell-507723d2
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Maydell_nr_102
2 CONT
2 CONT Sutlem, Wredenhagen i Haggers socken och Tockumbeck i Goldenbecks socken, alla i Estland. Ävensom Reps och Toickfer i Livland. Hopman på Lode i Livland 1588. Amiral över flottan på Peipussjön 1591-1593. Ridderskapets hauptman och 
2 CONC lantråd i Estland 1593-1598. Tygmästare i konung Sigismunds här och tillfångatagen i slaget vid Stångebro 1598. Förordnad amiral över några av Sigismunds skepp i Östersjön, ämnade att undsätta polska besättningen i Kalmar 1599-06-
2 CONC 02. (Elggenstierna V.).
2 CONT
2 CONT * VIII.2  http://daten.digitale-sammlungen.de/~db/bsb00000602/images/index.html?seite=556&fip=193.174.98.30
2 CONT
2 CONT * VIII. ex. II. 4 https://personen.digitale-sammlungen.de/baltlex/Blatt_bsb00000558,00624.html?prozent=
2 CONT
2 CONT * https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/T%C3%B6nnes_Maydell
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ADen civila lokalförvaltningen i Sverige 1523-1630 : med särskild hänsyn till den kamerala indelningen / Joh. Ax. Almquist. Tredja delen, Häft 4. Stockholm 1922, Lk 259 
2 CONT
2 CONT Liivi Aarma: Tõnnis Maydels Vater war Tönnies Maydel, Sohn von Hans (Johan) Maydels, wer alle seine Erben gab dem Sohn Tönnies 1541 - Olde Hans Maydell trägt seinen Sohn Töniges Maydel und seinen Hof Suttelem gerichtlich auf. Kopi
2 CONC e);   Dieser Sohn war Vater von Admiral Tönnies Maydell.
2 CONT
2 CONT Stavenhagen, Oskar: Genealogisches Handbuch der kurländischen Ritterschaft, Bd.: 1, Görlitz, [1939], lk 541 (admirali isa ja tema pojad)
