2 CONT DEATH 28 Mar 1557 (aged 51–52)
2 CONT Cambridge, City of Cambridge, Cambridgeshire, England
2 CONT BURIAL
2 CONT St Mary the Great Churchyard
2 CONT Cambridge, City of Cambridge, Cambridgeshire, England 
2 CONT MEMORIAL ID 219626319 
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice Olivia Jenawaye Warren born about 1505, married about 1526 at Bassingbourn, Cambridgeshire, England, Richard Warren son of Sir John and Lady Margaret De Leigh Warren.
2 CONT
2 CONT Known Children:
2 CONT 1 Richard Warren, Jr 1527 - Died 29 November 1580, Cambridge, Cambridgeshire, England.
2 CONT 2. Hellen Warren 1527 Md John Robert Foote. 7 Known Children. Died 18 July 1558. Buried: St Leonard Churchyard, Shoreditch, Greater London, England.
2 CONT 3. Nicholas Warren Abt 1531 - Died 25 Nov 1602, Bassingbourn, Cambridgeshire, England.
2 CONT 4. Henry Warren Abt 1533 - Died 1613 Bassingbourn, Cambridgeshire, England.
2 CONT 5. Alice Warren Abt 1535 - Died 9 October 1607 St Leonard Churchyard, Shoreditch, Greater London, England
2 CONT 6. Edward Warren Abt 1636 - Bassingbourn, Cambridgeshire, England. Died Unknown.
2 CONT 7. William Warren 1537 - Married Margaret Painter 3 Known Children. Died 23 May 1583 at Bassingbourn, Cambridgeshie, England.
