2 CONT *Notes, The New England Historical & Genealogical Register (NEHGS, Boston, Mass., 1910) Vol. 64, Page 186. [https://books.google.com/books?id=INfJxmPj2_wC&pg=PA186#v=onepage&q&f=false GoogleBooks]
2 CONT *http://livey.dyndns.org/phpgedview/individual.php?pid=I8776
2 CONT *Ancestral File Number: 840M-PR
