2 CONC  Richard Coffyn (c1280-??) to Sallie Coffin (1773-1850)[https://docs.google.com/document/d/1APRvBVCsrzN9ABMBJpqbgdsda0xJ6y8V7y70m-aEEYU/edit?usp=sharing] Legutki-1
