2 CONT He was buried at Great Amwell on 18 Aug 1614 as "Austen Walkar of Amwell Streete an owld man".  In the will of Augustine Walker, dated April 1613, he mentions "my daughter Elizabeth Warren wife of Richard Warren", and "her three c
