2 CONT Christopher ALMEY (4,8,10,11), son of Thomas ALMEY and Joan WALES,
2 CONT
2 CONT died (8) or interred (10) 4 Oct 1624 (8,10,11), interred South Kilworth (8,10,11), married first,
2 CONT
2 CONT .... _____ CLARKE, of Lutterworth, England (8,10,11). He married second by license
2 CONT
2 CONT ..... Anne GREENE or Annie GREENE, widow of Hurley, co. Warwick, England (8,10,11) who died (8) or was interred (10) 5 March 1622/3 (8,10,11) at South Kilworth (10,11), will dated 11 Apr 1621, proved 18 May 1626 by son Henry GREEN
2 CONC E (11).
2 CONT
2 CONT ... Children by 1st wife :
2 CONT
2 CONT ...*.i.William ALMEY (8,11), only son born ca 1600 (11) and
2 CONT
2 CONT ....?. Mary ALMEY (8,11), unmarried 2 Oct 1624 (8,11), perhaps the one who married at Ashby Parva, co., Leicester, 30 Oct 1627 
2 CONT
2 CONT .......... Samuel JEPHCOTE (11).
2 CONT
2 CONT ... Child by first wife (11) or second wife (10) 
2 CONT
2 CONT ..?. Joan ALMEY (will 11) or Katharine ALMEY (marriage license 11), married 1618 
2 CONT
2 CONT .......... John PAULE (10,11), of Ashby Parve, co. Leicester., a yeoman (11), with 3 children, William, Christopher, and Richard before Oct. 1624 (11).
2 CONT
