2 CONT
2 CONT .... Joan WALE, (8,10,11), dau of Thomas WALE (8,10,11) of Dunton-Bassett (10,11), interred Dunton-Bassett Leics. England, 31 Oct 1604 (8,10,11).
2 CONT
2 CONT ... Children 4:
2 CONT
2 CONT ..i. Thomas ALMEY (8,10,11) of Badby County Northampton (10,11).
2 CONT
2 CONT ...ii. William ALMEY (8,10,11), of Bitteswell, Co. Leicester (10,11).
2 CONT
2 CONT ..iii. John ALMEY (8,10,11), of Lutterworth (10,11).
2 CONT
2 CONT ..*.vi. Christopher ALMEY (8,11). 
