1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Rogers/6000000187506162853?through=6000000004829097866 and https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Nason/6000000003391180533 are not the same.  They are first cousins.  (Elizabet
2 CONC h (Rogers) Nason → Richard Rogers, of Stratford-upon-Avon her father → Thomas Rogers, of Stratford-upon-Avon his brother →  Elizabeth Rogers  his daughter [https://www.geni.com/path/Elizabeth-Nason+is+related+to+Elizabeth-Rogers?f
