2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret PACE 1, 2, 3 was born 1541 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England. She died Jul 1581 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret married 4 Thomas ROGERS on 31 Jan 1563 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Elizabeth ROGERS 1, 2 was christened 25 Oct 1563 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died Nov 1569 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England and was buried 5 Nov 1569 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas, Henry, John, William and Richard Rogers had numerous children baptized and buried. Of these I pick out the children of Thomas:
2 CONT
2 CONT Baptized.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth, October 28, 1563.
