2 CONC wland_of_fenstanton.pdf Link to online PDF].
2 CONT #Manorial Court Roll for Fenstanton, 1614, Huntingdon Archives, HMR7. Howland was not found referenced in the Fenstanton rentals of 1591 or 1616, nor the manorial court rolls of 1617-1621. He was also not listed in the terriers fo
2 CONC r townlands 1632-1644 (HP27/25/2/1), nor on the receipt of inhabitants for 1633 (HP27/25/2/2); nor in any apprenticeship records (HP27/14/1-2).
2 CONT #Churchwarden accounts for Fenstanton, 1630. Huntingdon Archives HP27/5/2. No record of Howland was found in the 1627 churchwarden accounts which also survive.
2 CONT #Cherry, Lina Vandegrift Denison. ''Ancestry of My Three Children: Lewis Williamson Cherry, George Denison Cherry, Carolyn Vandegrift (Cherry) McDonnell''. United States, n.p, 1945, p. [https://archive.org/details/ancestryofmythre
2 CONC 00cher/page/315/mode/1up?view=theater 315].
2 CONT #Gilbert, Hilah Scott. ''Ancestors of Heather J. Gilbert, Susan Scott Gilbert and Allyn Ellsworth Gilbert, Jr''. Chrisman, IL: unknown, 1963, p. [https://www.ancestry.com/imageviewer/collections/28456/images/dvm_GenMono007911-0001
2 CONC 7-1?ssrc=&backlabel=Return&pId=30 29]. [Ancestry.com: subscription required.] (no free image available).
2 CONT #Huntingdonshire: Fen Stanton: St Peter and St Paul: Register of unspecified type: "Parish Register" database, FreeREG (https://www.freereg.org.uk/search_records/58180251e93790ec75a7aa38: viewed 19 Nov 2022) burial Henry Howland 1
2 CONC 7 May 1635.
2 CONT #"England, Huntingdonshire Parish Registers", database, FamilySearch (https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:WQC6-WP2M: 11 February 2021), Henry Howland, 1635.
2 CONT #Davis, William Goodwin. ''The Ancestry of Annis Spear, 1775-1858, of Litchfield, Maine''. (1945), p. [https://archive.org/details/ancestryofanniss1987davi/page/104/mode/1up?view=theater 103]. Text: ''Henry Howland of Fenny Stanto
2 CONC n, co. Huntington, was born in the latter half of the sixteenth century.''
2 CONT #Christensen, Grace Hildy Croft. ''The Benson Family: Descendants of Isaac Benson and Mary Bumpas, and Allied Families: Archer, Bumpas, Howard, Knapp, Lewis, Luce, Meech, Milks, Potter, Reynolds, Waite, Whipple, Williams, Et Al''.
2 CONC  2d Ed. United States, n.p, (1973), p. 681. Text: ''Henry Howland, b. abt. 1564.''
