1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *http://daten.digitale-sammlungen.de/~db/bsb00000559/images/index.html?seite=129&fip=193.174.98.30
2 CONT *http://dic.academic.ru/dic.nsf/ruwiki/1573476
2 CONT *http://personen.digitale-sammlungen.de/baltlex/Blatt_bsb00000559,00129.html?prozent=
2 CONT *http://translate.google.fi/translate?hl=sv&sl=et&tl=en&u=http%3A%2F%2Fet.wikipedia.org%2Fwiki%2FNasackin&sandbox=1
2 CONT * Family [https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9D%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%8B '''Насакины'''] in Википедия, in Russian.
2 CONT * Family [https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nasackin_(Adelsgeschlecht%29 '''Nasackin'''] in Wikipedia, in German
2 CONT * Family [https://et.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nasackin '''Nasackin'''] in Wikipedia, in Estonian. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Adelsvapen===
2 CONT
2 CONT Family [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Nassokin_nr_740 '''Nassakin'''] in Adelsvapen, in Swedish: 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TAB 1'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Feodor Nasackin''', Russian boyar. Married to Maria Putilova.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Leontij Nasackin'''. Rysk bojar. Var jämte sin äldste son i tsar Ivan IV:s här, då denne 1558–1561 inföll i Estland. Stannade i Estland och förvärvade betydande jordområden i Hapsals län, däribland Keskfer i S:t Martens socke
2 CONC n. Gift med Maria N. N., död 1590 i Hapsal.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Afanasi''', died 1613. (Tab. 2.)
2 CONT * '''Peter'''. Major. Died ca. 1640. (Tab. 4).
2 CONT * '''Anna'''. Married to a Russian boyar, later Colonel in Swedish military, Peter [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Rosladin_nr_45 Rosladin (n:o 45)].
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT Some Swedish historians believed that Nasakins family come from Nashchokins. They believed, that Leonti Nasakin was a son of Fyodor Naschokin, in that case Leonti would brother of Athanasius Fedorovich Naschokin, also known as "Zl
2 CONC oba".
2 CONT
2 CONT Refutation of this theory gives Lind J. H. De Ingermanlandske «Ryss-Bajorer». Deres sociale og genealogiske baggrund // Gentes Finlandiae. 1984.
2 CONT
2 CONT He also refutes the version that Maria Putilova was the mother of Leonti.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Nassokin_nr_740#TAB_1 Elgenstierna, Gustaf: Den Introducerade Svenska Adelns Ättartavlor 5, p. 375. Genealogisches Handbuch der livländischen Ritterschaft, Livland, p. 768-769. Baltische Genealo
2 CONC gische Mitteilungen Nr. 2/1934, p. 23.
