1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Leijonhufvud_nr_26#TAB_3
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.historyofroyalwomen.com/the-royal-women/margaret-leijonhufvud-the-good-wife/?fbclid=IwAR1xkL6nHs6WX7UJTeGiOJXfeihJoz7Z__gldhfC07q4qa1Zl4J8GAArnis
