2 CONT Jan "Ciężki" Tarnowski (c. 1479–1527) was a Polish nobleman (szlachcic).
2 CONT
2 CONT Jan was castellan of Biecz and Sącz, starost of Pilzno. He had one child, Dorota Tarnowska.
2 CONT
