1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Children of John Clarke and Margaret were:
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Thomas Clarke b bef 4 Jan 1543/44, of Finningham, Suffolk, England; md Dorothy.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.geneajourney.com/clarkej.html
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Clarke (John1) chr 4 Jan 1543/1544 Finningham, Suffolk, Eng. Res: Finningham, Suffolk, Eng. Thos Clarke taxed 13s. 4d. in lands valued at £5 at Finningham in subsidy of 1575/6. May have taken possession of father's holdings
2 CONC  in Gislingham & pt of Finningham estate as, in 1581, Thos Clerke & wife Dorothea were amg others who transferred lands in Finningham & Gislingham to Thos Talbott for £80.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT G A Moriarty, "Clarke-Cooke (alias Carewe)-Kerrich" NEHGR, Vol 75 (1921), p 273-301
2 CONT
2 CONT He m Dorothy<nowiki>------</nowiki>, c1672. They had following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Joan Clarke, Bur 24 Jan 1573/1574 Finningham, Suffolk, Eng
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Thomas Clarke, chr 9 Jan 1574/1575 Finningham, Suffolk, Eng, Bur 11 Jan 1574/1575 Finningham, Suffolk, Eng
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Mary Clarke, chr 3 Apr 1576 Finningham, Suffolk, Eng
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. Thomas Clarke, chr 16 Aug 1578 Finningham, Suffolk, Eng
