1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Thomas Rogers (about 1540-1611) married 2nd, on 31 January 1563 to Margaret Pace (1541 - ), eleven children: Elizabeth, Charles, Joan, Alice, Joanna, Joyce, Alice, Richard, William, Edward, Anne.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT >“The burial of Margaret, the wife of Mr. Rogers, I did not find. He evidently married again; I took notes of the following marriages: 1581 November 5, Richard Rogers and Ales Calle. for I found the burial of "Alice Wyf to Mr Thom
2 CONC as Rogers," August 17, 1608. His own burial is thus given: 1610 (11) February 20, Thomas Rogers, one of the Aldermen.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://freepages.rootsweb.com/~hwbradley/genealogy/aqwg503.htm#8140
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret PACE 1, 2, 3 was born 1541 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England. She died Jul 1581 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England. Margaret married 4 Thomas ROGERS on 31 Jan 1563 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, En
2 CONC gland.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT *  		F	i	Elizabeth ROGERS 1, 2 was christened 25 Oct 1563 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England. She died Nov 1569 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England and was buried 5 Nov 1569 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, Eng
2 CONC land.
2 CONT *  		M	ii	Charles ROGERS 1, 2 was christened 28 Mar 1565 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England. He died Mar 1609 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England and was buried 30 Mar 1609 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, Engl
2 CONC and.
2 CONT *  		F	iii	Joan ROGERS 1, 2 was christened 24 Jan 1567 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England. She died Feb 1567 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England and was buried 21 Feb 1567 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, Engla
2 CONC nd.
2 CONT *  		F	iv	Alice ROGERS 1 was christened 1 Sep 1568 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England. She died Oct 1568 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England and was buried 3 Oct 1568 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England.
2 CONT *  		F	v	Joanna ROGERS was christened 14 Oct 1571.
2 CONT *  		F	vi	Joyce ROGERS was christened 9 Feb 1573.
2 CONT *  		F	vii	Alice ROGERS was christened 12 Sep 1574.
2 CONT *  		M	viii	Richard ROGERS 1, 2 was christened 10 Dec 1575 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England.
2 CONT *  		M	ix	William ROGERS 1 was christened 8 Jun 1578 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England.
2 CONT *  		M	x	Edward ROGERS was christened 18 Feb 1580.
2 CONT *  		F	xi	Anne ROGERS 1 was born 1581 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England. She died Jul 15 1581 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England and was buried 24 Jul 1581 in Stratford on Avon, Warwickshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://books.google.com/books?id=caGKnZ6GsR0C&pg=PA181&lpg=PA181&dq=Thomas+Rogers+1610&source=bl&ots=ZKdkF46cf5&sig=zVNN840XofajK51n7LBHmZLtMKY&hl=en&ei=sS-hTLKxJIjSsAOZj7Vo&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=4&ved=0CCIQ6AEwAw#
