2 CONT
2 CONT The Parish Registers of Stratford upon Avon commence Anno 1558. By the kind permission of the Vicar, the Rev. George Arbuthnot, M.A., I was enabled to devote the whole of one day, from the close of the morning service to the begin
2 CONC ning of the afternoon service, to an examination of them.  … Thomas, Henry, John, William and Richard Rogers had numerous children baptized and buried. Of these I pick out the children of Thomas.
2 CONT
2 CONT Baptized 
2 CONT
