2 CONT # Joyce, February 9, 1572 (3).
2 CONT # Ales, September 11, 1574.
2 CONT # Richard, November 10. 1575.
2 CONT # William, June 8, 1578.
2 CONT # Edward, February 18, 1579.
2 CONT
