1 NAME Richard /Lake/ of North Benfleet
2 GIVN Richard
2 SURN Lake
2 NSFX of North Benfleet
2 _MARNM Lake
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1539
2 ADDR
3 CITY Rayleigh
3 CTRY England
1 BURI
2 DATE 24 SEP 1599
2 PLAC North Benfleet, Essex, England
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 24 SEP 1599
2 ADDR
3 CITY North Benfleet
3 CTRY England
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lake Ancestry in England
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard and Anne (Wardell) Lake
2 CONT
2 CONT Richard LAKE - b. about 1539, possibly at Rawreth, Essex; bur. Sep. 24, 1599, North Benfleet, Essex. His will, dated Sep. 17, 1599, names sons John and Richard, daughters Margaret, Sybil and Joan by their married names, and his br
2 CONC other William. The names of his parents are not known, and connections to extended lines through Lancelot LAKE and Margaret TWISLETON appear to be conjecture. Richard LAKE had at least three brothers and two sisters. Brother John 
2 CONC LAKE married first on Feb. 3. 1558/9 at Runwell, Essex to Elizabeth LONE (bur. Mar. 10, 1588/9, North Benfleet), and second on Apr. 28, 1589 at North Benfleet to Mary CASTLE. The latter was married second on May 26, 1597 at North 
2 CONC Benfleet to John GREENE of Rawreth, Essex. Richard's brother Robert LAKE had a daughter Susan (bap. Aug. 22, 1574, Runwell, Essex; bur. there Oct. 8, 1574) and other children. Richard's brother William LAKE was living and married 
2 CONC in Sep. 1599. One of Richard's sisters married Mr. PORTER and had sons John and George, and another married Mr. BROOMAN and had son John. Richard also had a "sister CRACKNELL", but it's unclear if she was a sister or sister-in-law
2 CONC . Richard resided with his brother John LAKE at Great Fanton Hall, Essex in 1596.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anne WARDELL - b. about 1543; d. Sep. 22, 1599, Wickford, Essex.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Richard and Anne Lake
2 CONT
2 CONT *    1. John - b. 1565, Essex. 
2 CONT *    2. Richard - Named in the wills of his uncle (1596) and his father (1599), he was still living in Dec. 1622 when his wife died. Married Sara (bur. Dec. 17, 1622, North Benfleet, Essex). Children of Richard and Sara LAKE: Tabi
2 CONC tha; and Sarah died as infant. 
2 CONT *    3. A daughter - Died before the date of her father's will. Married George REIGNOLDE. They had children. 
2 CONT *    4. Margaret - Married before Sep. 1599 to Mr. PHENNYNGE. 
2 CONT *    5. Sybil - Married on Oct. 11, 1591 at North Benfleet, Essex to Thomas LACHYNGDON. 
2 CONT *    6. Joan - Married on Apr. 10, 1592 at North Benfleet, Essex to Robert DUCKET of Thundersley, Essex. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Weblinks:
2 CONT
2 CONT * http://archiver.rootsweb.ancestry.com/th/read/GEN-MEDIEVAL/1998-04/0891642325
2 CONT * http://miller-malcom-familytree.net/descendants_of_unknown_lake.htm
