2 CONC ncestry-of-bethia-harris-1748-1833-wife-of-dudley?indId=externalindividual-3a3b8d0dfaba999a3630e831aee53cd2&mrid=9e8d158fd4c9b76b13e93db0fdbc3fd0&snippet=e367147568bd80cced142b2ba408ae0d MyHeritage] > 
2 CONT * http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2284.htm#i68653
