1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Robert Tilley 
2 CONT * Birth: ABT MAY 1540 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England 
2 CONT * Death: BEF 21 FEB 1612/13 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England 
2 CONT * Father: William TYLLE b: ABT 1515 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England 
2 CONT * Mother: Agnes wife of William Tylle b: ABT 1520 in or near Henlow, Bedfordshire, England Alt. spellings for Tilley: Tylle, Tille.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Family==
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage 
2 CONT # Elizabeth wife of Robert (Tylle) Tilley b: ABT 1550 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England Married: BEF 1571 in or near Henlow, Bedfordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT #  John TILLEY b: BEF 19 DEC 1571 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England
2 CONT #  Rose Tilley b: BEF 8 MAY 1574 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England c: 8 MAY 1574 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England
2 CONT #  George Tilley b: BEF 28 JAN 1575/76 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England c: 28 JAN 1575/76 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England
2 CONT #  Agnes Tilley b: BEF 6 MAR 1578/79 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England
2 CONT #  Elizabeth Tilley b: BEF 26 JAN 1581/82 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England c: 26 JAN 1581/82 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England
2 CONT #  William Tilley b: BEF 1 SEP 1585 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England c: 1 SEP 1585 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England
2 CONT #  Edward Tilley b: BEF 27 MAY 1588 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England c: 27 MAY 1588 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England
2 CONT #  Alice Tilley b: BEF 28 FEB 1589/90 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England c: 28 FEB 1589/90 in Henlow, Bedfordshire, England
2 CONT
2 CONT ==notes==
2 CONT
2 CONT Contributed by Geni Member [http://www.geni.com/people/Debra-Anne-Wray-Chmielowiec/6000000015084954388 Anne] June 2014
2 CONT
2 CONT I do not believe (wife) Elizabeth's last name has been definitively determined. I've not found any source documentation other than:
2 CONT
2 CONT [The following is a transcribed excerpt from The American Genealogist, Vol. 52, 1976, Article: English Ancestry of Seven Mayflower Passengers: Tilley, Sampson and Cooper, by Robert Leigh Ward, page 203.]
2 CONT
2 CONT RobertA Tilley (WilliamB , ThomasC, HenryD) of Henlow, yeoman, b. say 1540, bur. Henlow, 21 Feb. 1612/3; will dated 31 Dec. 1612, proved 6 April 1612 [sic: should be 1613]. He m. ca. 1570, Elizabeth <nowiki>--------</nowiki>, bur.
2 CONC  Henlow, 27 March 1614. She had a daughter, Mary Farr, mentioned in Agnes Tylle's will, 1582, and William Tylle's will, 1578/9, whose baptism does not appear in the Henlow registers, and who is not mentioned in Robert Tilley's wil
2 CONC l, 1612. Robert was executor of the will of William Ellborne of Henlow, shearman, dated 16 Jan. 1587/8, proved 1 Oct. 1588 (Archdeaconry of Bedford 22:55).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT John1, bapt. Henlow, 19 Dec. 1571, d. Plymouth, Mass., 1621.
2 CONT
2 CONT Rose, bapt. Henlow, 8 May 1574; m. Henlow, 24 June 1599, John Goods. No children recorded at Henlow.
2 CONT
2 CONT George, bapt. Henlow, 26 Jan. 1576/7, living 1582, d. before 1612.
2 CONT
2 CONT Agnes, bapt. Henlow, 6 March 1579/80, living 1582, d. before 1612.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth, bapt. Henlow, 26 Jan. 1582/3, living 1612, possibly bur. 20 Feb. 1624/5 Henlow; probably m. Henlow, 11 Feb. 1587/8, son of William and Mary (Bromeham) Austin alias Kent. [Children of Elizabeth and Richard omitted here.]
2 CONT
2 CONT William, bapt. Henlow, 1 Sept. 1585, bur. There 18 Jan. 1624/5.
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward1, bapt, Henlow, as Edmond, 27 May 1588, d. Plymouth, Mass. 1621.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alice, bapt. Henlow, 28 Feb. 1590/1, bur. There 29 July 1597.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kind regards, 
2 CONT Anne
2 CONT
2 CONT =============================================
