2 CONT
2 CONT RobertA Tilley (WilliamB , ThomasC, HenryD) of Henlow, yeoman, b. say 1540, bur. Henlow, 21 Feb. 1612/3; will dated 31 Dec. 1612, proved 6 April 1612 [sic: should be 1613]. He m. ca. 1570, Elizabeth --, bur. Henlow, 27 March 1614.
2 CONC  She had a daughter, Mary Farr, mentioned in Agnes Tylle's will, 1582, and William Tylle's will, 1578/9, whose baptism does not appear in the Henlow registers, and who is not mentioned in Robert Tilley's will, 1612. Robert was exe
2 CONC cutor of the will of William Ellborne of Henlow, shearman, dated 16 Jan. 1587/8, proved 1 Oct. 1588 (Archdeaconry of Bedford 22:55).
2 CONT
