1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Agnes Bonville''' was born circa 1569.1 She was the daughter of Richard Bonville. 1 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Hugh Crocker, son of John Crocker and Agnes Servington, circa 1580. 2
2 CONT
2 CONT From circa 1580, her married name became Crocker.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Agnes Bonville and Hugh Crocker:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.Francis Crocker+1 d. c 1659
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.John Crocker+1 b. 1589, d. 1646
