1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He and neither of his wives were not the parents of Margarethe, Gertrud and Anna von Ungern as falsely described in various genealogical sources. In fact they were the daughters of his brother Fromhold and his wife
2 CONC  Anna Gutsleff.
2 CONT
2 CONT Heinrich had only one daughter, also an Anna (who married Magnus Aderkas), with his first wife Katharina von Hülsen gen. von Ekeln and none from his 2nd marriage with Margarethe Zweiffel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT Baltische Familiengeschichtliche Mitteilungen Nr.1/1934, p. 27-28.
