1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Erik Johansson (Vasa)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of JOHAN Kristiernsson & his second wife Birgitta Tordsdotter Bonde (1470-executed/murdered Stockholm 8 Nov 1520).
2 CONT * Erik Johansson ( Vaasa ) , born 1470 at Örbyhus Castle , died 8 November 1520 at Stortorget ( executed at the Stockholm massacre ), was a Swedish knight and councilor , mainly known as the father of later King Gustav Vasa .
2 CONT * District Chief, Courtier, Knight and Royal Father
2 CONT * Johansson was district chief in Danderyd and Rydbo, in the years 1504–05 courtier at Kastelholm's castle on Åland and also owned the manor Rydboholm in Uppland .
2 CONT * Erik Johansson Vasa . Acted at Stockholm's bloodbath 1520-11-08. Heardshövding in Danderyd and Rydbo shipwreck. Knight and counselor. He was, as a person, quite intimidated, arrogant, opposed to conflict, harsh and, moreover, ve
2 CONC ry violent. Appealed to court several times for committing crimes. One of the crimes was theft in Ekerö church building, another was the murder of a man who illegally committed an intrusion on Eriks farm.
2 CONT * Lord of Rydboholm Castle in Roslagen, Johan was first cousin of Charles VIII of Sweden's father, Knut. 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000001230037346?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000172043015855 '''The Vasa family's older medieval weapon before Gustav Vasa turned the weapon into a shard'''] 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married about 1492-95 with '''Cecilia Magnusdotter,''' daughter of Magnus Karlsson (Ekaätten) and Sigrid Eskilsdotter Banér . His widow Cecilia and her daughters died in Danish captivity in 1522.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Birgitta Eriksdotter,''' † young.
2 CONT * '''Gustav I,''' † 1560, King of Sweden. The governor of Sweden for the years 1521-08-13 to 1523-06-06. King of Sweden from 1523-06-06 to 1560-09-29. Married 1: o 1531-09-24 in Stockholm with Princess Katarina of Saxony-Lauenburg
2 CONC  . Daughter of Duke Magnus I of Saxony-Lauenburg and Catherine of Braunschweig-Wolfenbüttel . Married 2: o 1536-10-01 in Stockholm with Margareta Eriksdotter Leijonhufvud , daughter daughter of the Swedish National Council and nat
2 CONC ional marshal Erik Abrahamsson Leijonhufvud and Ebba Eriksdotter Vasa . Married 3: o 1552-08-22in Vadstena Castle's wedding hall with Countess Katarina Stenbock , daughter of the Reverend Countess Gustaf Olofsson Stenbock and Libe
2 CONC rian Birgitta Eriksdotter Leijonhufvud .
2 CONT * '''Margareta Eriksdotter,''' † 1536-12-31 in Reval. Married 1: o 1516-03-30 at Stockholm Castle with Joachim Brahe . Married 2: o 1525-01-15 in Stockholm with the council, Count Johan by Hoya .
2 CONT *'''Måns,''' dead young.
2 CONT * '''Märta Eriksdotter,''' † in Copenhagen around 1522.
2 CONT * '''Johan,''' dead young.
2 CONT * '''Emerentia Eriksdotter,''' † in Danish captivity around 1522.
