1 CONT (+) John Cotton, jun., son of the Rev. John Cotton, minister of the first church in Boston. 
1 CONT He was then preaching, temporarily, in Wethersfield. 
1 CONT
1 CONT (*) The original will of Mrs. Foote, alias Welles, from which I copy, is in the hand-writing of 
1 CONT Rev. Joseph Rowlandson, minister of Wethersfield,--the codicil, or "Memorandum," in that 
1 CONT of Samuel Tallcott, of Wethersfield, son of John Talcott, one of the first settlers of Hartford. 
1 CONT
