1 CONT [143983.GED]
1 CONT
1 CONT Carpenter by trade
1 CONT Religion:  Quaker
1 CONT He was apprenticed to the house carpenter trade and with his master Randall Holden came to Portsmouth in 1630.  After completing his time he married Mary Paine.
