1 CONT JOHN TRIPP (John1). Born bef 8 Sep 1611 in Horkstow, Lincolnshire, England. At the age of <1, John was baptized in Horkstow, Lincolnshire, England, on 8 Sep 1611. John died in Portsmouth, Newport Co., RI, bef 28 Oct 1678; he was 6
1 CONC 7. Occupation: Carpenter. Religion: Quaker. In 1639 when John was 27, he married Mary PAINE, daughter of Anthony PAINE & Susanna POTTER, in Rhode Island. Born in 1615 in Newport Bagnell, Buckinghamshire, England. Mary died in Port
1 CONC smouth, Newport Co., RI, on 12 Feb 1686/1687; she was 71. They had the following children:
