1 CONT He came to America in 1642 with his wife and 5 children, his mother aged
1 CONT 58 years and two unmarried sisters. Went to Salisbury, Mass. where he had
1 CONT an Inn and ferry across Merrimac river. Went to Nantucket in 1659. Owned
1 CONT one fourth of Nantucket.
