1 CONT Sarah, b. probably in England ca 1614; d. probably in Dartm outh , after Jul 15 1696 (when she posted bond "being a ver y ancient woman"), dau. of Pilgrim Richard and Elizabeth (_ ___) Warren.  Sarah arrived at Plymouth Colony on 
