1 CONT BIOGRAPHY: JOHN DEANE - B. abt. 1597, d. 1660, Taunton, Massachusetts.. M. Alice ____. He came to New England with his brother, Walter in 1637 on the Speedwell and settled in Taunton, Massachusetts. John died April 1660, Taunton, 
1 CONC Massachusetts, "aged 63 or thereabouts." John's will is dated April 25, 1660
