1 CONT Hester came over on the fourth ship called the "Little James."  (Two ships, the Anne and the Little James, left together for America, but were separated and arrived in Plymouth a week to ten days apart.)
0 @N6000000003490614888@ NOTE Hester was a Walloon.  The Walloon Church had been established in Holland by Protestant refugees from France about 1581.  
