1 CONT From: CRobin925@aol.com
1 CONT Subject: [MFLR] Wright Brothers descended from Richard Warren (Mayflower)
1 CONT Date: Sun, 29 Jun 2003 17:10:52 EDT
1 CONT
1 CONT Since this is the 100th Anniversary year of the first flight by Orville and
1 CONT Wilbur Wright, it may be of interest to note that they were descended from
1 CONT Richard Warren of the Mayflower. "Notable Kin" by Gary Boyd Roberts gives the line
1 CONT as follows"
1 CONT
1 CONT Richard Warren and Elizabeth [now known to be Walker]
1 CONT Anthony Snow and Abigail Warren
1 CONT Lydia Snow and Stephen Skeffe
1 CONT ______Skeffe and __________
1 CONT Kezia Skeffe and Edmund Freeman
1 CONT Edmund Freeman and Martha Otis
1 CONT Edmund Freeman and Sarah Porter
1 CONT Dan Wright and Sarah Freeman
1 CONT Dan Wright Jr and Catherine Reeder
1 CONT Milton Wright and Susan Koener
1 CONT Orivlle and Wilber Wright
1 CONT
1 CONT The unusual gap results from the fact that Stephen Skeffe mentions his
1 CONT grandaughter Kezia Skeffe in his will. The Warren silver book 18 part 1, p. 31,says
1 CONT she was probably illegitimate and that it is "virtually certain" that she is
1 CONT the Kezia who married Edmund Freeman.
1 CONT
1 CONT It is interesting that the Wright Brothers, the first humans to fly in a
1 CONT heavier-than-air machine were distant cousins of Alan Sheppard, the first American
1 CONT in Space, and that their common ancestor was one of the first white settlers
1 CONT of America.
1 CONT
1 CONT Charles L
1 CONT Robinson, Omaha, NE
1 CONT
1 CONT
