1 CONT Over on the Ann in 1623. Brought Richards 5 daughters with her.
1 CONT Warren of the Mayflower," The American Genealogist 78 (2003):81-86. Davies presents the will of Augustine Walker of Great Amwell, Hertfordshire, the father of Elizabeth Walker who married there on 14 April 1610 Richard Warren. The
1 CONC  will names three daughters of this couple, the names and ages being in close agreement with what we know of the family of Richard Warren of the Mayflower, thus strongly supporting the contention that this marriage belongs to the 
1 CONC immigrant to Plymouth in 1620.
1 CONT
1 CONT SOURCES:
1 CONT TAG 78 [203]:81-86
