1 CONT John was of the Lake family of Normanton, Yorkshire, who claimed descent from "William the Conqueror".  He is related to Sir Edward Lake who died in 1674 and buried in Lincoln Cathedral in England.  John married in England to Marg
1 CONC aret Read dau. of Edmond Read.  John died in England, his widow Margaret, with her sister Elizabeth (Read) Winthrop, wife of Gov. John Winthrop, and her two daughters came to New England.  Margaret lived in Ipswich, MA and died th
1 CONC ere.
