1 CONC 1, Elizabeth Reade Winthrop died..." ; p. 384:  "Margaret Lake (d. 1672) had been a resident of Saybrooke, but had passed the winter of 1645-46 with John and Elizabeth Winthrop in Massachusetts.  Mrs. Lake's husband, John, was sep
1 CONC arated from her, for reasons unknown, for many years." ; p. 138: [1646] -" (She would continue for a number of years as a member of their household.)" 
