0 @N6000000006442458635@ NOTE        REF CAG6 13th signer of the Mayflower Compact.
1 CONT        REF SEM John Howland fell overboard on the trip over on the
1 CONT        Mayflower, but was rescued. He was Governor John Carver's
1 CONT        servant. In those days, a servant was a person who was bound to
1 CONT        a certain master for a definite term, as distinct from a person
1 CONT        who worked for day wages.
1 CONT        Famous descendants: President George Herbert Walker BUSH.
1 CONT     b. BEF 1593
1 CONT     d. 23 Feb 1672-3, Plymouth, MA
1 CONT
